<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nuiti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nuiti</para>
  <para style="toc3">TɠN</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nuiti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ta-Zɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi ɠa Izilayɛle ná-wɔlɔwɔlɔ vai zuɠulazu, siɛgi zu ti Kanaan yooi ná ta zoga la mɔunpa. Naama yeeɠɛɠala pɛ ge ɠɛni nɔ ga kpakagi ta unmɔɔgi. Izilayɛle ɠɛɛ vaa wɔlɔma ɠɛni de, ti ɓena tɔɔzei ga kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti dɛbia nɔ feya, GALA ma ge ɓena zou ɠili buzeɠe ti laalɔɠɔma, naati ti ɗa ti maanɔɠɔ. Naa ʋoluma nuɓusɛi ɓena ɠaaɠale ma GALA pɔ, ti kpee loo goizu, naazu ɠa GALA ge ɠɛni totuɠɔi ta wuzeɠezu la, niiti ti laaseigi ɠɛni ga «tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti,» nii a kɛ ma nu lo nuɓusɛiti tuɠɔ, é ti unmɔɔ ti-zili nuiti ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nu nɔpɛ ge la Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui ɠwɛɛ. Toɠa wosu ga GALA goo wo nui Samiyɛle ɠa é sɛʋɛa. Nu ɠa zoo bosu ga ladalai ga sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛʋɛ, siɛgi zu masa ge ɠɛni la niina Izilayɛle unda, tɔɔzei sɛʋɛi ɓɔɠɔi ɠa bosu ná zeizu ɠɛ mɔinmɔin, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Naama ziɛgi zu, masa ge la ɠɛni Izilayɛle unda» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 17:6">17:6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:1">18:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 19:1">19:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 21:25">21:25</ref></char>). Ni Izilayɛle nuiti kula vai Ezipete yooi ʋa, naa ɠɛɛni kona waagila unnaanigɔ (1.400) ɠɛɠala, aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ, naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga fai niiti ti wogai Tukpɔɠaaleʋe Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi zu, naati kɛɛʋɛ kona waagila unsaʋagɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta kona waagila kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔi (1.300-1.050), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ, konagi naa zu ɠa Sayile zeini la ga masagi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Kɔɔ ɠaaɓelagi Izilayɛle kɔɔni Kanaan nuiti daalɔɠɔma Zozuwe zaa ʋoluma, tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta-yeeɠɛɠalai lɔɔzeizuʋɛ, siɛgi zu GALA ge ɠɛni totuɠɔiti buzeɠezu la, nii a kɛ ti lo Izilayɛle luɠɔ ta ti unmɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 1:1-3:6">1:1—3:6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui niiti GALA ge ɠɛni ti wuzeɠezu ga ti ɓɔ Izilayɛle ʋa, naati ta-vaiti suɠula vai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 3:7-16:31">3:7—16:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɓaka fai tanigaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 17:1-21:25">17:1—21:25</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋele wolodaiti <optbreak/> ta-yooi zo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1"/>Zozuwe zaai ma, Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi zaama, ɓɛ ɠa a li mɔunpa, é kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Kanaan nuiti ba?»<verse eid="JDG 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Zuda ɠa mɔunpa a li, gè zooi lɔa zeezu.»<verse eid="JDG 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3"/>Zuda nuiti ti ɠɛni ti-ɠɛɛloin Simiyɔn ná-nuiti ma: «Ade lɛ wo ɓɔ gi ʋa zooi naa vaa zu, nii feai gi ya, ade Kanaan nuiti sakpe, gá ɓalaa gá ʋilɛ wo ʋolu, ade li naama yooi zu, nii feai wo ya.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 1:3">Simiyɔn ná-nuiti ti ʋilɛni ti ʋolu ti li. <verse eid="JDG 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4"/>Zuda nuiti ti lɛɛni, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Kanaan nuiti dɔɔni ti yeezu, ta Felɛze nuiti. Ti zunu waapuugɔ (10.000) ʋaani naati ba Ɓezɛke. <verse eid="JDG 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5"/>Ti masagi Adoni-Ɓezɛke ɠaani Ɓezɛke, ti sakpeni, ti zobogi zɔlɔɔni Kanaan nuiti ma, ta Felɛze nuiti. <verse eid="JDG 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6"/>Adoni-Ɓezɛke ɓizɛni, kɛlɛ ti ʋilɛni polu, ti so, ti zeezinɛkpotogiti ta kɔɠɔzinɛkpotogiti teʋeni ba. <verse eid="JDG 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7"/>Adoni-Ɓezɛke ɠɛni ma: «Masa puulɔfela (70), niiti ti ti-yeezinɛkpotogiti, ta ti-ɠɔɠɔzinɛkpotogiti teʋeni ba, naati ti ɠɛni daamianigi mɔtai yɛʋɛzu, nii é ɠɛni loozu, é ɗa ɠula nà-taɓalii ɠa. GALA ge naa ɠɛa ga ze, nii gè kɛɛni.» Ti liini la Zeluzalɛme, miná ɠa é zaani ná.<verse eid="JDG 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8"/>Zuda nuiti ti laalɛɛni Zeluzalɛme wu, ti soni. Ti ma laai zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ paa, ti abui lo taai ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9"/>Naa ʋoluma, ti liini ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Kanaan nuiti ba, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini gize yooi zu, ta lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ yooi zu, ta ziɛlaʋɛ ma nɛmɛi zu.<verse eid="JDG 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10"/>Zuda nuiti ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛni Kanaan nuiti ba, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Eɓelɔn, nii daaseigi ɠɛni mɔungi ga Kiliyate-Aaleɓa. Ti zobo sɔlɔɔni Sesayi nuiti ma, ta Ayiman nuiti, ta Talamayi nuiti. <verse eid="JDG 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11"/>Ti zeɠeni miná, ti li ti Deɓiil nuiti sakpe. Mɔungi, Deɓiil laaseigi ɠɛni ga Kiliyate-Seefɛɛl. <verse eid="JDG 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12"/>Kalɛɓe ɠɛni ma: «Nà dòun anzanui Akasa ve naama nui ʋɛ ga anza, nii a Kiliyate-Seefɛɛl zakpe, é so.» <verse eid="JDG 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13"/>Kalɛɓe deɠei Kenaze ná-doun zunui Woteniyɛle ɠa é ná zoni. Kalɛɓe ná-doun anzanui Akasa veeni bɛ ga anza. <verse eid="JDG 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14"/>Seeliai ma sinigi ʋɔ bɛ, é dɛɛni ga naa, ga naa kpalagi ta vali kɛɛɠɛ Kalɛɓe ma. Naa ʋolu, Akesa ʋilini, é zeɠe ná-soovalegi ɠɔma. Kalɛɓe gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa wɔin è ma?»<verse eid="JDG 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15"/>É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Faanɛɛ ɠɛ bɛ̀! Ziɛungaa ve bɛ̀, mazɔlɔɔ zooi è sèiɗai su, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, naa vɔɔʋɛ.» Kalɛɓe ziɛungiti feeni bɛ maazu ʋelei, ta buu ʋelei.<verse eid="JDG 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16"/>Ken nuiti, Moize nɛkoi mavofodaiti, ti zeɠeni Zeliko, Dɔza Taa Wolai, ta Zuda nuiti, ti li ti zei nuɓusɛiti saama, teʋebai zu Zuda yooi zu, ʋɛ ná Alade lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17"/>Zuda nuiti ti ɓɔni ti-ɠɛɛloin Simiyɔn ná-nuiti ba, ti li ti Kanaan nuiti sakpe, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Sefate. Ti nuɓusɛiti kpein suwuɠaaleʋeni, ti taai ɠoloɠolo ɲɛgɛlɛin. Ti taai naa laasei pɛɛni ga Ɠɔɔlema (nii poluʋɛ ga «é ɠoloɠologa»). <verse eid="JDG 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18"/>Zuda nuiti ti Gaza zoni ɓalaa, ta Asekalɔn, ta Ekelɔn, ta naama laa wolaiti maaɠoolii ma yooiti. <verse eid="JDG 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛni ti ʋa, naa ɠa é kɛɛni Zuda nuiti ti zoo, ti gize yooi zo. Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zooni, ti ʋa pɛtugi zu nuiti kpɛ, mazɔlɔɔ naati, kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti ti ɠɛni naati zea, nii é ga kɔlu geleiti. <verse eid="JDG 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20"/>Kalɛɓe Eɓelɔn zɔlɔɔni, eɠɛʋelei Moize ma levei veeni la. É Anake mavofoda saʋagɔiti kpɛɛni ná. <verse eid="JDG 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodai la ɠɛni Yeɓuse nuiti kpɛɛni, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Zeluzalɛme, naati ta dɛ zeini Zeluzalɛme zaaɠaza, ta Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodai.<verse eid="JDG 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele wolodaiti <optbreak/> ta-yooi zo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22"/>Zozɛfe mavofodai ɓalaa liini, é laalɛ Ɓetɛle wu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ti ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23"/>Ti nuiti teʋeni ga ti Ɓetɛle taai ʋɛtɛ, nii mɔungi daaseigi ɠɛni ga Luze. <verse eid="JDG 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24"/>Keelaiti ti zunu ɠila kaani, é ɗa ɠula taazuʋɛ, ti ɠɛni ma: «Pele lɛ ga giye, ʋɛ gá lɔ ná taazuʋɛ, gá nuɓɔɠɔla ɠɛ è ʋɛ.» <verse eid="JDG 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25"/>Pelei ta lɛɛ la taazuʋɛ, é naa lɛɛni ga tiye. Ti taa nuiti kpein paani, kɛlɛ ti zunui naa ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei yɛni ná, naati ti li. <verse eid="JDG 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26"/>Zunui naa liini Ɠɛte nuiti ta-yooi zu, é taai loni ná, é daasei pɛɛni ga Luze, daaseigi naa ɠa é ba zaaɠaza.<verse eid="JDG 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27"/>Manasé nuiti ti la ɠɛni Ɓɛte-Seyan nuiti kpɛɛni, ta Taanake nuiti, ta Dɔɔl nuiti, ta Yiɓileyame nuiti, ta Megido nuiti, ta ti-ʋaalobaiti kpein. Kanaan nui naati ti yɛni zeini ma yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28"/>Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔni la, ti ɠɛni duɔla wotii veezu ti ya, ti ɗa kɛ, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni ti ɓɛɛni.<verse eid="JDG 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29"/>Efelayime nuiti ti la ɠɛni Kanaan nuiti kpɛɛni, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Gezɛɛl, naati ti yɛni zeini Efelayime nuiti saama.<verse eid="JDG 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30"/>Zaɓulɔn nuiti ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa Kitilon nuiti kpɛ, ta Naɠalɔle nuiti. Kanaan nui naati ti yɛni zeini Zaɓulɔn nuiti saama, kɛlɛ naati ti ɠɛni duɔla wotii veezu ti ya, ti ɗa kɛ.<verse eid="JDG 1:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31"/>Asɛɛl nuiti ti la ɠɛni Ako nuiti kpɛɛni, ta Sidɔn nuiti, ta Aalaɓe nuiti, ta Akiziɓe nuiti, ta Ɠɛleɓa nuiti, ta Afike nuiti, ta Leɠɔɓe nuiti. <verse eid="JDG 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32"/>Asɛɛl mavofodaiti ti zeini Kanaan nui naati saama, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini zooi naa zu, mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠɛni ti ɓɛɛni.<verse eid="JDG 1:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33"/>Nɛfɛtali nuiti ti la ɠɛni Ɓɛte-Semɛse nuiti kpɛɛni, ta Ɓɛte-Anate, ti yɛni zeini Kanaan nui naati saama, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini zooi naa zu. Kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni duɔla wotii veezu taa wola felegɔi naati su nuiti zea, ti ɗa kɛ.<verse eid="JDG 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34"/>Amool nuiti, ti Dan ná-nuiti kpɛɛni, ti lɛ gize yooi zu, ti la ɠɛni vaani bu ga ti yei nɛmɛi zu. <verse eid="JDG 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35"/>Amool nuiti ti yɛni zeini Ɠaal-Ɠelɛse, ta Ayalon, ta Saalaɓime, kɛlɛ Zozɛfe mavofodai zɛbɛi ɠɛni liizu ga wɔɔlɔa ti laalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛni duɔla wotii veezu ti ya, ti ɗa kɛ. <verse eid="JDG 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36"/>Amool nuiti ta-ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ liini gize yɔɠɔzuʋɛ Akelaɓime, é zo Sela, é li ná ʋoluʋelei.<verse eid="JDG 1:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti ti la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni <optbreak/> ga wooɠɛɠila nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-keelai zeɠeni Gilegale, é ʋa Ɓokime, é ɓɔɛni Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè wo ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa, gè ʋaani ga woye zooi naa zu, nii gè minazeɠeni ná-faa zu, gè ma ɠonai wo, wo-mɛmɛwolani bɛ. Gè ɠɛni ma: ‹Eyɛsu ɠɔ, gè la nà-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa wo letema. <verse eid="JDG 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2"/>Wɔun wa, wo la minazeɠe boga niima yooi ma nuɓusɛiti bɛ, wa ta-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti toka.› Kɛlɛ wo la woiloni gòoi ma. Lee vaa zu wo naa ɠɛɛni? <verse eid="JDG 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3"/>Názu ɠa gè ɠɛni la ma, gè la ti ɓɛɛzu wo luɠɔ, ta yɛsu wo ɠoba, ta-ɠalagiti ti ɠɛ ga baliiti wo luɠɔ.»<verse eid="JDG 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4"/>Siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-keelai niima wooiti boni la Izilayɛle nuiti ma, nuɓusɛiti ti tɔɔzeini ga wɔlɔa. <verse eid="JDG 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5"/>Ti naama adaʋɛ laasei pɛɛni ga Ɓokime (nii poluʋɛ ga «gɔlɔ nuiti»). Ti zalaɠaiti kulani ná Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zozuwe zaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6"/>Zozuwe yeeɓeni nuɓusɛiti ba, Izilayɛle nuiti ti liini ti zooi zeɠe, ti ɠilagilagi zei ná-poganii unda. <verse eid="JDG 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbizu, Zozuwe zii ma voloi pɛ su, ta kɛwolai naati kpein ta-ziɛgi zu, niiti ti ɠɛni ma ta Zozuweni, ti kɛɛwoti wolaiti kpein kaani, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ɠɛɛni, Izilayɛle ná-faa zu.<verse eid="JDG 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8"/>Nun ná-doun zunui Zozuwe, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-botiɠɛ nui zaani, siɛgi zu ná-konagi ɠɛni la ga ungila puugɔ (110). <verse eid="JDG 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9"/>Ti maaɠuluni ná-zooi ma, nii é sɔlɔɔni ga nɔnɔ Timinate-Ɠelɛse, Efelayime ɠize yooi zu, Gaase gizei lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10"/>Ma ɠɛɠalamaiti kpein ɓalaa ti zeɠeni ná, ti za. Ɠɛɠalama ɠili ge wuzeɠeni naati poluma, nii é la ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠwɛɛ, anɛɛ kɛɛwotii nii é kɛɛni Izilayɛle ná-faa ma.<verse eid="JDG 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛlɛ vai <optbreak/> Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11"/>Názu ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni la, ti Ɓaale ɠalagiti dɛbini. <verse eid="JDG 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12"/>Ti ɠɛlɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, ti-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI, nii é ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa, ti ʋilɛ gala kiligiti polu, nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠalagiti saama, niiti ti ti-maaɠoolii zu. Ti ɠɛni nɔkɔsu ti wu, ti ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawana. <verse eid="JDG 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13"/>Ʋele ɠana ti ɠɛlɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, ti ɗa Ɓaaleni dɛbi ta Asetaateiti.<verse eid="JDG 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Izilayɛle nuiti ma. É ɓeni ti ʋa, toosu nuiti ti loo ti ma, é la ti maaloboni. É ti lɔɔni ti zili nuiti zeezu, niiti ti ɠɛni ti-maaɠoolii zu, ti la zobo sɔlɔɔni, ti ʋa lo ti zili nuiti daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="JDG 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15"/>Siɛnɔpɛ su ta la liina la kɔɔmaʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni suɠoloɠolosu ti ya, eɠɛʋelei é boni la ti ma, é ma ɠonai wo. Ʋele ɠana ti lɔɔni la iɲɔteʋe wolai zu.<verse eid="JDG 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti buzeɠeni, niiti ti ti ɠizoni, ti ti ɠula ti zili nuiti zea, niiti ti ɠɛni loozu ti ma. <verse eid="JDG 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni woilosu ta-lukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti gooi ma. Ti ɠɛni nɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔzu ga gala kiligiti, ti ɗa nɔkɔ ti wu. Ti ɠɛni zeɠezu gaamanɔ naama ʋelei ʋa, nii ti-mɛmɛwolani ti ziɛni la, niiti ti ɠoloni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ʋɛ, ti la ɠɛni ʋokɔɠɔni naati ma, ti-ziɛ ʋelei ɠɛni yɛ. <verse eid="JDG 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18"/>Siɛnɔpɛ su Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui leʋesu da, é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu naa ʋa, é ti unmɔɔ, é ti ɠula ti zili nuiti zeezu, tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui naa ná-yeeɠɛɠalai kpein su. Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI a la ná-nuɓusɛiti kaana, ti ɗa kpeei loo unbawului wu, ti zili nuiti zea, ti ɗa ti maanɔɠɔ, ti maawɔin ɠɛni sosu. <verse eid="JDG 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui a la zaana la, nuɓusɛiti ti ɓena tɔɔzei ga ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔa mɔnɔ, é leʋe ti-mɛmɛwolani tɔnɔi ʋa, ti ʋilɛ gala kiligiti polu, ti ɗa ti lɛbi, ti ɗa nɔkɔ ti wu, ti la ɠɛni yeeɓesu ti-zɔ ɲɔiti ba, ta ta-ɠikpaaiti.<verse eid="JDG 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ge Izilayɛle lɔɔ vai <optbreak/> ʋoluɠulai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Izilayɛle ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Tɔɔzei niima nuɓusɛiti ti nà-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa, nii gè boni ti-mɛmɛwolani bɛ, tɔɔzei ti la ɠoloni gòoi ʋɛ, <verse eid="JDG 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21"/>nɔ̀un nà, gè la mɔ zii niiti gila kpalaa kpɛa, tɛiti ti yɛgai ná, eyɛsu Zozuwe za, <verse eid="JDG 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22"/>naa ɠa a kɛ gè ti ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle ʋoluɠula anii, gè kwɛɛ, ni ta ziɛ ga nà-pelei, eɠɛʋelei ti-mɛmɛwolani ti ziɛni la, ti ɠolo bɛ̀.» <verse eid="JDG 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zii naati zɛni ná, ti zei ziilɛigi zu, é la ɠaazuvilɛni ga ti ɓɛa, tɛiti é la ɠɛni ti lɔɔni Zozuwe yeezu.<verse eid="JDG 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1"/>Ziiti pɛtɛ, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti yɛni zooi zu, ga ti ɠɛ ga ʋoluɠula anii Izilayɛle ʋɛ, tiya ɠa ti la ɠɛni Kanaan yooi zo fai ma ɠɔɔi ta ɠɔɔni. <verse eid="JDG 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2"/>Naa ɠɛ ungi ɠɛni ga ɠɛɠalama niinɛi, é wuzeɠezu Izilayɛle nuiti saama, niiti ti la kɔɔɠɔ vaa ɠwɛɛ, naati ti kɔɔɠɔ vai maalɛlɛ. <verse eid="JDG 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Filisiti nuiti ta-masada lɔɔlugɔi ma nuɓusɛiti zɛni zooi zu, ta Kanaan nuiti kpein, ta Sidɔn nuiti, ta Ɠeve nuiti ti ɠɛni zeini Liɓan ɠizeiti ma, é zo Ɓaale-Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn gizei ma, eyɛsu é zeeli Leɓo-Ɠamate. <verse eid="JDG 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4"/>Zooi naati ti ɠɛni ná, Izilayɛle ʋoluɠula vai ma, ni ta ɠolo deveiti bɛ, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti veeni ti-mɛmɛwolani zea ga Moize maaʋele.<verse eid="JDG 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti zeini Kanaan nuiti saama, ta Ɠɛte nuiti, ta Amool nuiti, ta Felɛze nuiti, ta Ɠeve nuiti, ta Yeɓuse nuiti. <verse eid="JDG 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6"/>Ti zooi naati su nuiti ti-loun anzanuiti seini ga ti-anzaiti, ti ti-loun anzanuiti fe naati ti-loun zunuiti bɛ ga ti-anzaiti, ti ɗa ta-ɠalagiti dɛbi.<verse eid="JDG 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woteniyɛle, <optbreak/> tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle unda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni. Ti yeemani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALA ma, ta-ƓALAGI, ti li ti ɗa nɔkɔ Ɓaaleni bu, ta Aselani. <verse eid="JDG 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Izilayɛle ma, é ti ʋɔdini Mezopotami masagi Kusan-Liseyatayime ma. Ti duɔlai ɠɛɛni Kusan-Liseyatayime yeezu ga kona dɔsaʋa. <verse eid="JDG 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9"/>Ti kpeei looni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu, naa unmɔɔ nu wuzeɠeni Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, naa ti ɠizoni, Woteniyɛle ɠɛni ga naa, nii é ɠɛni ga Kenaze ná-doun zunui, Kalɛɓe deɠei. <verse eid="JDG 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui ɠɛni tɔun ba. É ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle unda. É liini ga kɔɔi Kusan-Liseyatayime laalɔɠɔma, Mezopotami masagi, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zobogi veeni bɛ, é pilɛ sɔlɔɔ naa ma. <verse eid="JDG 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11"/>Ziilɛigi ɠɛni zooi zu ná pɛ, kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu. Kenaze ná-doun zunui Woteniyɛle zaani.<verse eid="JDG 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eɠude, <optbreak/> tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle unda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni mɔnɔ. Naa maaʋele ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Moaɓe masagi Egelon iɲɔdɔɔni, é wuzeɠe Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="JDG 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13"/>Egelon Amɔn nuiti kpɔni ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ta Amalɛke nuiti, ti li ti laalɛ Izilayɛle wu, ti zobogi zɔlɔɔni ma, ti kpɛ ti kula Zeliko ʋa, Dɔza Taa Wolai, ti so. <verse eid="JDG 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti lɔɔni duɔlai zu, Moaɓe masagi Egelon yeezu, kona puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18) laawu.<verse eid="JDG 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti kpeei looni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu, naa unmɔɔ nu leʋeni ti ma ga Eɠude, Ɓɛnzamɛn nui, Gela ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni ga kɔʋɛ nui. Izilayɛle nuiti ti valini ma ga é li ga maazoloo ganii Egelon ʋɔ, Moaɓe masagi. <verse eid="JDG 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16"/>Eɠude boɠa zɔkpɔi ɓɛtɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ga gaavelegi, é ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ lukpɛgi, é gilini ná-saamaɠiligi ʋa ná-seɠei wu, ga zeezazu ʋele kpalai ma. <verse eid="JDG 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17"/>É liini é maazoloo ganii ve Egelon ya, Moaɓe masagi. Tama Egelon ɠɛni ga zunui, nii gola wɔɔlɔni. <verse eid="JDG 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18"/>Siɛgi zu é ɓeni da ga maazoloo ganii ve zea, é yeeɓeni zunuiti ba, ti li, tɛiti ti ʋaani ga anii naati. <verse eid="JDG 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19"/>Seeliai ma kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti pɔ bɛ, ti ga kɔtui, Gilegale ɠobaʋɛ, é ɠaleni ma ʋolu, é ɠɛ masagi ma: «Ee, masagi, keela woo ɠa zèa, è ʋɛ, é ga dɔɔɠuzu vaa.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Masagi devei veeni ga ti ɓe ba, niiti kpein ti ɠɛni ná, naati pɛ ti ɠulani pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="JDG 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20"/>Názu ɠa Eɠude maaɓuɠani la masagi ʋa, é ɠɛni zeini sangasoi wu maazuʋɛ, nii é makɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ dooɠo bosuʋɛ maazuʋɛ, fiilɛi ɠa. Eɠude ɠɛni ma: «GALA ná-keela wooi ɠa é zèa, ga é wo è ma.» Masagi wuzeɠeni ná-kpɔkpɔgi zu. <verse eid="JDG 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21"/>Eɠude ɠɔʋɛi maaleni yeezazu ʋelei, é boɠa zɔkpɔi mɛɛnni, é pu ba kogi zu. <verse eid="JDG 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22"/>Ma ungi ɓalaa lɔɔni, ma mɛɛngi lɔa ʋoluma, ma wulɔi ziɛni ma mɛɛngi ma, é naa laaɠulu. Mazɔlɔɔ boɠa zɔkpɔi folokulani ga poluʋelei, é la ɠɛni mɛɛnni, é ʋa kula. <verse eid="JDG 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23"/>Eɠude ɠulani ga pɛlɛ ʋoluʋelei, é daaɠulu, é sɔɠɔgi loo.<verse eid="JDG 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠulani la, masagi ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti liini ti naa ʋɛtɛ, ti kaani ga sangasoi ma ʋɛlɛlaʋɛti daaɠuluni, sɔɠɔgi loo. Ti ɠɛni ma: «Tanisu, toɠa ɠɛ latini pɛlɛi ʋolu.» <verse eid="JDG 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25"/>Ti ɓɔlɔni ga maaɓɔunga, kɛlɛ tɛi é la ɠɛni sangasoi ma ʋɛlɛlaʋɛti daalaoni maazuʋɛ, ti kpakui zeɠeni, ti daalao, pɛtɛ ti-maliɠii ɠɛni laani zooi ma, saai.<verse eid="JDG 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26"/>Tɛi ti wola lɛbini maaɓɔungi ɠa, Eɠude ʋelani. Kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ti ga kɔtui, é naati pɔ bɛ maazuɓudɛni, é ʋela é li Seyila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27"/>Seeliai ma miná feya, é puʋugi vɛɛni Efelayime ɠize yooi zu. Izilayɛle nuiti ti yeini, ti zeɠe gize yooi zu, é loni ti untuɠɔ.<verse eid="JDG 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À ʋilɛ pòlu, mazɔlɔɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Moaɓe nuiti dɔa wo yeezu, wo zili nuiti.» Ti ʋilɛni polu, ti Zuludɛn maaleʋesuʋɛti so Moaɓe yooi letemaʋɛ, ti la nu nɔpɛ zɛni ná, é ʋa ziɛ wolai maazuɓudɛ. <verse eid="JDG 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29"/>Naama voloi, ti zunu waapuugɔ (10.000) ʋaani Moaɓe nuiti ba, ti pɛ ti ga zunuiti ti zuloga, kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti, gila kpalaa ge la ɠulani. <verse eid="JDG 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30"/>Naama voloi, Moaɓe unmaayeini Izilayɛle yeewu. Ziilɛigi lɔɔni zooi zu, eyɛsu kona ʋuulɔsaʋa (80) laawu.<verse eid="JDG 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samegaal, <optbreak/> tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle unda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31"/>Tɔun poluma, Anate ná-doun zunui Samegaal ɠa é wuzeɠeni. É zunu undɔzita (600) ʋaani Filisiti nuiti ba, ga nikɛ maaɓɛɛ lukpɔi kɔlu ɠaazoɓagi ga. Tɔ ɓalaa é Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti unmɔɔni.<verse eid="JDG 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4"/>
  <para style="s">Deɓola, <optbreak/> tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle unda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1"/>Eɠude zaa ʋoluma, Izilayɛle nuiti ti tɔɔzeini ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛa. <verse eid="JDG 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti lɔɔni Kanaan masagi Yaɓin yeezu, nii é ɠɛni masadai ɠɛɛzu Ɠasɔɔl taa wolai unda. Ná-kɔɔɠɔ ɠundiɠii ɠɛni ga Sisela, é ɠɛni zeini Ɠalosɛte-Goyime. <verse eid="JDG 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3"/>Kɔlu wotolo untaaʋuugɔ (900) ɠa é ɠɛni Yaɓin ya, é Izilayɛle nuiti gola zopele ɲɔuni, kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) laawu. Naati ti kpeei looni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu ga é ɓɔ ti ʋa.<verse eid="JDG 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Lapidɔte anzai Deɓola, GALA goo wo anzanui, é ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5"/>É ɠɛni zeizu dɔɔ wului wu, ti daasei pɛɛni ga Deɓola ná-dɔɔ wului, Lama ta Ɓetɛle ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ, Efelayime ɠize yooi zu. Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni liizu pɔ bɛ faawo bo fai ma. <verse eid="JDG 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6"/>Foloi ta, é keela leʋeni Ɓalake ma, Aɓinoame ná-doun zunui, Kedɛse nui, Nɛfɛtali yooi zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI devei, nii veeʋɛ è ya: ‹Li è zunu waapuugɔ (10.000) laasei sɛʋɛ, Nɛfɛtali ná-bolodai zu, ta Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodai, è lo ti luɠɔ, wo li Taɓɔɔl gizei ma. <verse eid="JDG 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7"/>Nà ʋaazu ga Yaɓin ná-kɔɔɠɔ ɠundiɠii Sisela è ʋɔ, ziɛ wolai Kison ʋɔ bɛ, ta ná-wotoloiti, ta ná-salaʋusuiti, nà ti lɔɔzu è yeezu.› »<verse eid="JDG 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8"/>Ɓalake Deɓola wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa ʋilɛ pòlu, nà li, kɛlɛ ni è la ʋilɛni pòlu, gè la lia.»<verse eid="JDG 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9"/>É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ʋilɛsu è ʋolu, de li, kɛlɛ è la lɛbiya zɔlɔɔga pelei naa zu, è ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔzu su, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa Sisela lɔɔzu anzanu yeezu.» Deɓola ʋilɛni Ɓalake ʋolu, ti li Kedɛse. <verse eid="JDG 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10"/>Ɓalake Nɛfɛtali ná-bolodai lolini Kedɛse, ta Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodai. Zunu waapuugɔ (10.000) ʋilɛni polu, Deɓola ʋɛɛni ti ʋa, ti li.<verse eid="JDG 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11"/>Ma ziɛgi nɔ zu, Ɠeɓɛɛl, Ken nui, ɓeteʋeni Ken nui zɔiti ba, Woɓaɓe mavofodaiti, Moize nɛkoi, é liini é ná-seɠe ɠotai lo Kedɛse, Saananime sɛne gului ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12"/>É woni Sisela ma, ga Aɓinoame ná-doun zunui Ɓalake lɛa Taɓɔɔl gizei ma. <verse eid="JDG 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13"/>Sisela ná-salaʋusuiti gaalɛɛni ba, ta kɔlu wotolo untaaʋuugɔ (900). Ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti kpein ti liini Ɠalosɛte-Goyime, ziɛ wolai Kison ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="JDG 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14"/>Deɓola ɠɛni Ɓalake ma: «De liina! Za ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Sisela lɔɔzu la è yeezu, è pilɛ sɔlɔɔ ma. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi ɠa losu è luɠɔ.» Ɓalake loni zunu waapuugɔ (10.000) untuɠɔ, ti Taɓɔɔl gizei yei. <verse eid="JDG 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Sisela ɓɛɛni ta ná-wotoloiti, ta ná-salaʋusuiti, é ti pɛ kpɛɛni ga boɠa zɔkpɔi Ɓalake luɠɔ. Sisela ɠulani ná-wotoloi zu, é ʋilɛ ɠɔɠɔa, é ʋela. <verse eid="JDG 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16"/>Ɓalake ʋilɛni wotoloiti polu, ta salaʋusuiti, eyɛsu ti zeeli Ɠalosɛte-Goyime, ti Sisela ná-salaʋusuiti kpein paani. Nu ɠila kpalaa ge la ɠɛni ɠulani.<verse eid="JDG 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17"/>Sisela ɓizɛni ɠɔɠɔa, é li Ken nui Eɓɛɛl anzai Yayɛle ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, mazɔlɔɔ ziilɛigi ma minazeɠegi ɠɛni Ɠasɔɔl masagi Yaɓin ta Ɠeɓɛɛl ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="JDG 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18"/>Yayɛle ɠulani, é Sisela laaɠomi, é ɠɛ ma: «Lɛ ʋɛ, màliɠii, lɛ pɔ̀ bɛ. Mina lua!» É lɛɛni ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, naa pɛɛmazeɠei ʋɛɛni ma.<verse eid="JDG 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Soma è ziɛ ve zèa, gè ɓɔɔle, kpɔɔle wɔin ɠa mà.» É kɔlɔ woolei laalaoni nɔnɔi su, é fe zea, é ɓɔɔle, naa ʋolu, é seɠei ʋɛɛ ma.<verse eid="JDG 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20"/>Sisela ɠɛni ma: «Li è lo seɠe ɠotai laaʋɛ, ni nu a ʋaana, é è ɠaazaɠa ga: ‹Nu ɠa ʋɛ?›, ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɓa-o!› »<verse eid="JDG 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21"/>Sisela wola ɓɔlɔa ɠɛni de, é ɲiini poun. Ɠeɓɛɛl anzai Yayɛle, seɠe ɠotai ma wulu ɠaazoɓagi ta zeɠeni, é pɛɛ malitoi ʋa, é maaɓuɠa ba vaavaa, é kpadɔ nɔungi ʋa, é folokula é zooi zo, é zaani.<verse eid="JDG 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22"/>Ɓalake yɛni Sisela ɓɛɛzu, é ʋa ná, Yayɛle ɠulani é daaɠomi, é ɠɛ ma: «Ʋa gè zunui lɛ ga ɗe, nii è gaiziɛzu.» É lɛɛni naa ʋɔ bɛ, é Sisela ɠa laani zooi ma, saai, seɠe ɠotai ma wulu ɠaazoɓagi nɔungi volokulaai.<verse eid="JDG 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23"/>Zekana, naama volo ná, GALA ge zobogi veeni la Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔ Kanaan masagi Yaɓin ma. <verse eid="JDG 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ta-zobogi liini ga wɔɔlɔa, Kanaan masagi Yaɓin laalɔɠɔma, eyɛsu ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="JDG 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5"/>
  <para style="s">Deɓola ná-guyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1"/>Naama voloi Deɓola ta Aɓinoame ná-doun zunui Ɓalake ti guyei looni, ti ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JDG 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2"/>Izilayɛle, ɛsɛ nɔungi viegɛ, kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ga é kɔɔi ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">nuɓusɛiti ti ɓɔɠɔ veeʋɛ ga ti kɔɔi ɠɔ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama!<verse eid="JDG 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3"/>Masagiti, à woilo gòo ma! Kundiɠiiti, à woilo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Nà guyei loozu, ungo, nɔ̀un, nà guyei loozu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">gè guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI!<verse eid="JDG 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, siɛgi zu è Seyiil ɠizei yeini la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">è ʋaai ma, è zeɠe Edɔme yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">zooi ɓalini, tonaɓiingi yeeɓeni tonai ʋa, é ʋu.<verse eid="JDG 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5"/>Gizeiti ti ɓusɛni è luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">Sinayi gizei ná-Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI.<verse eid="JDG 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6"/>Anate ná-doun zunui Samegaal ná-siɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">Yayɛle ná-siɛgi zu, peleiti kpein ti laaɠuluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">siɛ wo nuiti ti ɠɛni ziɛzu ga kaku peleiti.<verse eid="JDG 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛlɛni Izilayɛle laa wolaiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">ti ɠɛlɛni ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">eyɛsu nà, Deɓola, gè wuzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">gè wuzeɠe, eɠɛ doun deei Izilayɛle ʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti yiimazeɠeni ga gala kiligiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">gaamago nɔ, kɔɔi ʋaani ta-ziɠidaʋɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Kɔɔɠɔ nui waaʋuunaanigɔ (40.000) ɠa é Izilayɛle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">kɛlɛ kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛ gila kpalaa ge la ná, anɛɛ mɛɛn ɠila kpalaa.<verse eid="JDG 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9"/>Zìi ɠa zoolɛzu Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ta-vaa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">ti ɓɔɠɔ veai nuɓusɛiti saama, ga ti kɔɔi ɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">À mamagi ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!<verse eid="JDG 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10"/>Wɔiti wo lɛɛzu soovale saa ɠolegiti kɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">wɔiti wo zeini seɠe wolaiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">wɔiti wo ziɛzu peleiti su, à ɠigaiziɛ!<verse eid="JDG 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11"/>Niiti ti ziɛungiti kobaʋɛ, ti ɗa ziɛi ɠaaɠwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">ta Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-faanɛɛiti maamusɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">ná-faanɛɛiti Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti tetema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti ti yeini la, taa wolai ma ziɠidaʋɛti.<verse eid="JDG 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12"/>Wuzeɠe Deɓola, wuzeɠe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Ɠaalɔ, guye ɠila too!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Aɓinoame ná-doun zunui Ɓalake, wuzeɠe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Li ga ɗa-luɔiti.<verse eid="JDG 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13"/>Nui mɔtai zɛgai zobobɛ nuiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">GALA ge feeni naati bɛ, ga ti zei nuɓusɛiti unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feeni bɛ̀, ga nɔ̀un gè ɠɛ kɔɔ ɠundiɠiiti saama!<verse eid="JDG 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14"/>Niiti ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔgai Amalɛke ma, naati kulaʋɛ Efelayime.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Ɓɛnzamɛn ʋilɛni ti ʋolu, toɠa ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Makiil ná-pɛlɛyeɠei kundiɠiiti kulani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodai ma ge gaalu bo nuiti fe, ti sɛʋɛi ɠɛ ga sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui ná-tukpɔi.<verse eid="JDG 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15"/>Isakaal ná-kundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni Deɓola ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Isakaal ɠa Ɓalake ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">ti yeini nɛmɛi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Luɓɛn ná-nuiti saama, ɓɔɠɔɠaai woni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">kpɔɛzuɠulai woni, goolaama la ɠulani su.<verse eid="JDG 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16"/>Lee vaa zu è yɛni loni togani makɛsu felegɔi yɔɠɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">è ɗa woilo togani makɛ nuiti kpain gooi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Luɓɛn ná-nuiti saama, ɓɔɠɔɠaai woni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">kpɔɛzuɠulai woni, goolaama la ɠulani su.<verse eid="JDG 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17"/>Galaade yɛni Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Dan la zeɠeni ná-ɓatoiti koba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Asɛɛl yɛni zeini kpoloɗɛi laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">é zeini kpɛ, ziilɛigi zu, ná-ɓato losuʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18"/>Zaɓulɔn ɠa ga nuɓusɛi, nii tɛɠɛai saai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Nɛfɛtali ɓalaagi, zenɔ ɠana é la, kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19"/>Masagiti, ti ziliai ga giye, Kanaan masagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛni gi ʋa Taanake, Megido ɗɛiti pɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">kɛlɛ ti la liini ga ani nɔpɛ, wali ɓaa kɔɔzogani.<verse eid="JDG 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi zu, somideɠaiti ti kɔɔi ɠɔɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">ti ʋilɛni ti-ziɛ ʋeleiti ba, ti Sisela zakpe.<verse eid="JDG 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21"/>Ziɛ wolai Kison ti yɛʋɛni, é yei ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">wɔlɔwɔlɔ ɗɛ wolai, ziɛ wolai Kison.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">De ziɛ ga zɛbɛi!<verse eid="JDG 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22"/>Sooiti ti leʋeni ga kpizɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">ti-ʋolokagiti tugi ɗa ɠula, ti-lugi ɗa ɠula zooi ma.<verse eid="JDG 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">«À Meloze voovo! À foovo, wo ná-taai zu nuiti foovo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">Mazɔlɔɔ ti la ʋaani, ti ʋa ɓɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">ti ʋa ɓɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, kɔɔɠɔ ɠundiɠiiti saama!»<verse eid="JDG 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24"/>Yayɛle ɠa ga tuya nu anzanuiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Ken nui Ɠeɓɛɛl anzai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Tuyai ɠa bɛ, anzanuiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">niiti ti zeini seɠe ɠotaiti bu!<verse eid="JDG 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25"/>Sisela ziɛi valini ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">é nɔnɔi veeni naa ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">É nikɛ ɲiimiɗɛi ma wulɔi veeni zea lɛbiya ɗaawɔi zu.<verse eid="JDG 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26"/>É gulu ɠaazoɓagi zoni ga yeei gilagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">é botiɠɛ nuiti ta-malitoi zeɠe ga yeezai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">É Sisela loɠani ga malitoi, é naa nɔungi ʋalini su!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">É tooni, é nɔungi ɓota.<verse eid="JDG 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27"/>É zeini Yayɛle ɠɔɠɔwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">é looni, é la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">É zeini kɔɠɔwu, é looni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Ʋɛ é zeini ná, miná ɠa é looni ná, é zumaale, é za.<verse eid="JDG 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28"/>Maazuʋɛ, fenɛtɛlɛ laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">miná ɠa Sisela dee wɛlɛni ná, daavɔ, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">«Lee vaa zu ná-wotoloi lɛbisu, é la ʋaazu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Lee vaa zu ná-wotoloiti ti liizu vaa?»<verse eid="JDG 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29"/>É ɠɛni naa wosu nɔ ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">nii ná-botiɠɛ ɠima anzanuiti ti boni:<verse eid="JDG 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30"/>«Salaʋusuiti ti kɔɔzoganiiti ka ga bɔɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ti ɗa ti ɠaaɠwɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Anzalopo ɠila, ɓaa anzalopo felegɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">naa ve kɔɔɠɔ nui ɠilagilagi ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Sisela ɠa seɠe zupu ʋagɔi zɔlɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">seɠeiti ti ʋodaai, ti zuʋuai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">seɠe zuʋua felegɔi ɠa loo zobo sɔlɔɔ nui ɠɔba.»<verse eid="JDG 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è zili nuiti undaaʋili ɠana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Kɛlɛ niiti ti è nɛai ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">naati ti volo ga foloi ɠɛʋele, a ɠɛna toa gola!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Ziilɛigi lɔɔni zooi zu kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu.<verse eid="JDG 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6"/>
  <para style="s">Madiyan nuiti ti Izilayɛle ɓɔlɔ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni mɔnɔ. Naa ti lɔɔni Madiyan nuiti zeezu, kona dɔfela laawu. <verse eid="JDG 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2"/>Madiyan nuiti ti Izilayɛle wola ɓɔlɔni. Madiyan nuiti ta-vaa ɠa é kɛɛni, Izilayɛle nuiti ti lɔɔɠuzuʋɛti kpɛtɛni la gizeiti ba, ta pugiti, ta fasaiti. <verse eid="JDG 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3"/>Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ta la tii ɠɛɛna la, Madiyan nuiti ti ɠɛni lɛɛzu ta Amalɛke nuiti, siɛziɛ nuiti ti ga folo ɠulazu ʋele nuiti, ti li ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="JDG 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4"/>Ti ʋuuzuʋɛ ɓɛtɛni zooi zu, ti ɗa zooi zu ɠulanumai kpein koloɠolo, Gaza maaɠoolii zu. Ti la ɠɛni daamiani nɔpɛ zɛsu Izilayɛle nuiti zea, anɛɛ baalagiti, ɓaa nikɛiti, anɛɛ soovalegiti. <verse eid="JDG 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5"/>Ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ga ta-loganiiti, ta ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti, eɠɛ koto kpulugiti, nu la ɠɛni zooga, é ʋa ti ɠaalu, tiya-o, ta-ɲɔmɛiti-yo, ti ɠɛni ʋaazu zooi zu, zooi ɠoloɠolo fai ma.<verse eid="JDG 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6"/>Izilayɛle wola ʋalani, tɔɔzei Madiyan nuiti ba, Izilayɛle nuiti ti kpeei looni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu. <verse eid="JDG 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7"/>Siɛgi zu ti kpeei looni la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu, Madiyan ná-faa zu, <verse eid="JDG 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8"/>é GALA goo wo nui ta leʋeni ti ma, naa ɠɛni ti ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Gè lɛɛni ga woye, gè wo ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa, gè wo ɠulani duɔlai ma ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="JDG 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9"/>Gè wo ɠizoni, gè wo ɠula Ezipete nuiti zea, ta niiti kpein ti ɠɛni wo maanɔɠɔzu, gè ti ɓɛ wo luɠɔ, gè ta-yooi ve wo ya. <verse eid="JDG 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10"/>Gè ɠɛni wo ma: Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI, à mina nɔkɔ Amool nuiti ta-ɠalagiti bu, niiti wo zeini ta-yooi zu. Kɛlɛ wo la woiloni gòoi ma.› »<verse eid="JDG 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ge vali vai Zedeyɔn ma <optbreak/> ga é Izilayɛle unmɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ʋaani Wofela taazuʋɛ. É zeini sɛne gului wu, nii é ɠɛni loni Zoase ná-zooi zu, Aɓiyezɛɛl ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nui. Ná-doun zunui Zedeyɔn ɠɛni moloi loɠazu, dɔɔɓɔi kpɛtɛzuʋɛ, é ɗa dɔɔɠu Madiyan nuiti ba. <verse eid="JDG 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠulani kɛlɛma bɛ, é ɠɛni ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa è ʋa, kɔɔɠɔ nu wolai!»<verse eid="JDG 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13"/>Zedeyɔn gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, màliɠii, ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa gi ʋa, lee vaa zu niima maanɔɠɔ vaiti kpein ti zeizu gi ma? Poo golai naati ta mini, niiti gi-mɛmɛwolani ti-ma vaiti boni gi ma, siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni la gi ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é gi ɠulani Ezipete yooi zu›? Niizu é ɠɛlɛa gi ʋa, é gi lɔ Madiyan nuiti zeezu.»<verse eid="JDG 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaaʋoteni ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Li ga naama zɛbɛi, nii é è ʋa, ɗa Izilayɛle nuiti unmɔɔ, è ti ɠula Madiyan nuiti zeezu. Nà laade ɓaa, gè ʋa ɠɛ è leʋesu?»<verse eid="JDG 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15"/>Kɛlɛ Zedeyɔn ɠɛni ma: «Ee, màliɠii, leeni ɠa nà Izilayɛle nuiti kizo da? Nà-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠa gaalɔiɗai Manasé ná-bolodai zu, nà ɠa gè ga doungoi kɛ̀ɛ ná-doun zunuiti saama.»<verse eid="JDG 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Kɛlɛ nà ɠɛ è ʋa, ɗa zobo sɔlɔɔ Madiyan nuiti ma, eɠɛ zunu ɠila nɔ.»<verse eid="JDG 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni ma: «Ni è zaalai laa mà, poo fe zèa, nii nà kwɛɛ da, ga Màliɠii, ɗa ɠa è ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀. <verse eid="JDG 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18"/>Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, mina maaɠooza ʋɛ ʋa, eyɛsu gè ʋa ga nà-vebɛanii, gè da è ɠɔɠɔwu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Naa ɠɛni ma: «Nà yɛsu ʋɛ, eyɛsu è ɠale ma, è ʋa ʋɛ.»<verse eid="JDG 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19"/>Zedeyɔn liini é boli ɓokpagi ɓɛtɛ, é ɓɔ ɓulu vukɔi kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ʋa, é naa ɓɛtɛni ga ɓului, nii lɛʋɛ la su. É suai ʋuuni kpɔlɔgi zu, é sua ɗɛi ʋu pɔlɔ liɠii zu, é li ga tiye pɔ sɛne gului wu, é sei kakala.<verse eid="JDG 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20"/>GALA ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni ma: «Suai zeɠe ta ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, ti la kɔtu wolai tɛi maazu, è sua ɗɛi ʋu ti ma.» Zedeyɔn gooi zoni. <verse eid="JDG 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21"/>Tukpɔi é ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ya, é naa zokpai loni suai ʋa, ta ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su. Abui soni kɔtu wolai ʋa, é suai ɠala, ta ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su. Naa ʋolu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɲɛɛlɛni gaazu. <verse eid="JDG 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22"/>Zedeyɔn kwɛɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ʋe. É kpeei looni, é ɠɛ ma: «Màanɔɠɔa, Màliɠii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI! Mazɔlɔɔ gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠaa, ga gàazuʋɛ.»<verse eid="JDG 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Yiilɛi, mina lua, è la zaazu.»<verse eid="JDG 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24"/>Zedeyɔn zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ loni náʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é daasei pɛɛni ga «ziilɛi GALAGI». Toɠa dɛ ná, zaaɠaza Wofela taazuʋɛ, Aɓiyezɛɛl ná-pɛlɛyeɠei zaama.<verse eid="JDG 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zedeyɔn Ɓaale ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ <optbreak/> ɠoloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25"/>Ma ɓɔkɔi nɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «È-ɠɛɛ ná-nikɛ zinɛi zo, kona dɔfela gelei. Ɓaale ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠoloɠolo, nii é ga è-ɠɛɛ nɔnɔi, sale wului é loni koba, naa ɓalaa ɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="JDG 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26"/>Naama ɠizei maazuʋɛ ɠa è zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛzu ná, ga pagɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-ƓALAGI ʋɛ. Ɗa nikɛ zinɛi velesiɛi zo, è kula ga gala zalaɠai, sale wului nii è koloɠolosu, naa ɠa ɗa seɠe, è kɛ ga koʋii.»<verse eid="JDG 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27"/>Zedeyɔn zunu puugɔ zeɠeni ná-botiɠɛ nuiti saama, é naa ɠɛɛni nii kpein Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni ma. Kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni zooni, é ʋa naa ɠɛ ga foloi, kɛni kpidii, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni luazu kɛɛɠɛ ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋa, ta taaʋeaiti. <verse eid="JDG 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28"/>Siɛgi zu taaʋeaiti ti wuzeɠeni la ga sobuzobui, ti pɛtɛni ga Ɓaale ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠoloɠoloni, sale wului ɠoloɠoloni, nikɛ zinɛi ɠilagi ɠulani ga gala zalaɠai zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, naa ɓɛtɛa niinɛi. <verse eid="JDG 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29"/>Ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠasu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é naa ɠɛai?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:29">Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni gaazaɠagi wosu da, ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Zedeyɔn ʋe, Zoase ná-doun zunui, naa ɠa é naa ɠɛɛni.»<verse eid="JDG 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30"/>Gaamanɔ, taaʋeaiti ti ɠɛni Zoase ma: «È-loun zunui ɠula, kɛni é za, mazɔlɔɔ é Ɓaale ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠoloɠologa, ta sale wului é ɠɛni ná ɠobaʋɛ.»<verse eid="JDG 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31"/>Zoase maaɠoolii zu nuɓusɛiti gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wa ɠa wa Ɓaale maalogi wo bɛ ɓaa? Wa ɠa wa ɓɔ ba, wo kizo? Nu-o-nu a Ɓaale maalobona, ta naama nui ʋaa, aisa lina sobu. Ni Ɓaale ɠa ga gala, é ɓɔɠɔ maalogi wo ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, tɔɔzei ti ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓezeɠelega.»<verse eid="JDG 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32"/>É zo naama voloi ma, ti Zedeyɔn laasei pɛɛni ga Yeluɓaale (nii poluʋɛ ga «ɓaale ɓɔɠɔ maalobo»), tɔɔzei ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓaale ɓɔɠɔ maalobo tɔun daalɔɠɔma, tɔɔzei é ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠoloɠoloni.»<verse eid="JDG 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zedeyɔn poogi ɠaiziɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33"/>Madiyan nuiti ta Amalɛke nuiti, siɛziɛ nuiti ti ga folo ɠulazu ʋele nuɓusɛiti, ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti Zuludɛn ɓudɛ, ti li ti ʋu Zizeleyɛle nɛmɛi zu. <verse eid="JDG 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui yeini Zedeyɔn ma, é lɔ su. É puʋugi vɛɛni, é Aɓiyezɛɛl ná-pɛlɛyeɠei lolini, ti ʋilɛ polu. <verse eid="JDG 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35"/>É keelaiti teʋeni Manasé ná-zooi zu, ti naati tolini ti ʋilɛ polu. É keelaiti teʋeni Asɛɛl ná pɛ, ta Zaɓulɔn, ta Nɛfɛtali, naati ti lɛɛni ti ti laaɠomi.<verse eid="JDG 6:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni GALA ma: «Ni ɗa pɔ, è Izilayɛle ɠizo ga ze, eɠɛʋelei è bogai la, <verse eid="JDG 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37"/>wɛlɛ, nii ɠa gè falizu è ma, nà baala kɔlɔi ʋɛɛzu zooi ma, molo loɠazuʋɛ. Ni nɔɗai a ʋuuna baala kɔlɔi nɔ ma, zooi nii é maaɠoolii zu, ná pɛ maavɔai yɛ de, nà kwɛɛ gè ɠɛ ɗa pɔ è Izilayɛle ɠizo ga ze, eɠɛʋelei è bogai la.»<verse eid="JDG 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana é ɠɛɛni la. Poluma zobui, é wuzeɠeni ga sobuzobui, é li é baala kɔlɔi luɓa, ma nɔɗai kokoi laaveni.<verse eid="JDG 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni GALA ma: «Mina yiiɠaawana mà, gaazaɠa gila kpe nɔ ɠa gè bosu ga ɗe, poo gaaɓelagi é ʋilɛ baala kɔlɔi ʋa, tɔ ɠila kpe nɔ vɔai yɛ de, kɛlɛ nɔɗai zooi maaʋɛ kpein zɛɓɛ maaɠoolii zu.»<verse eid="JDG 6:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40"/>GALA ge naa nɔ ɠɛɛni mɔnɔ kpidii naa. Baala kɔlɔi ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa fɔai yɛni de, nɔɗai ʋuuni zooi ma ná pɛ.<verse eid="JDG 6:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7"/>
  <para style="s">Zedeyɔn <optbreak/> ta kɔɔɠɔ nu unsaʋagɔiti (300)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1"/>Poluma zobui, Yeluɓaale, nii é ga Zedeyɔn, ta ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti ʋilɛni pelei zu, ti liini ti ʋu Ɠalɔde ziɛungi ɠobaʋɛ. Madiyan nuiti ti ʋuuni ti ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, é zo Molé ɠizei ʋa, eyɛsu ma nɛmɛi zu. <verse eid="JDG 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «Nuɓusɛi é è ʋolu, naati gola mɔinʋɛ, gè ʋa va bu, ti ʋa pilɛ sɔlɔɔ Madiyan nuiti ma. Naa a ɠɛɛna, Izilayɛle nuiti ta waso nɔ̀un ma, ti ɠisiɛ ga ti ɓɔɠɔ zɛbɛi ɠa ti ɓɔɠɔ unmɔɔgai da. <verse eid="JDG 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3"/>Niima ɠaazaɠagi wo ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti saama, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa é wo zaama, é luazu sasu ɗa ɓali? É maaɠooza Galaade gizei ʋa, é li ná-taazu.› » Ná-kɔɔɠɔ nui zunu waaʋuufele maazu felegɔ (22.000) ɠa é ɠaleni ma, é yɛni ná ga zunu waapuugɔ (10.000).<verse eid="JDG 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «Kɔɔɠɔ nuiti gola mɔinʋɛ dɛ. Yei ga tiye kɔtuɗɛi ʋɔ bɛ, miná ɠa suwɛɛngi wosu ná. Nii nà ɠɛ è ma: ‹Nii ɠa ʋilɛ è ʋolu,› naa ɠa ʋilɛ è ʋolu. Kɛlɛ nii kpein nà ɠɛ è ma: ‹Nii mina ʋilɛ è ʋolu, wo ʋa li,› naa mina ʋilɛ è ʋolu, wo ʋa li.»<verse eid="JDG 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5"/>Zedeyɔn yeini ga ná-zunuiti kɔtuɗɛi laaʋɛ. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Nui nii kpein a laaʋɛ ziɛi ɠa, é ɗa kpɔle ga gilɛi ɠɛʋele, naati seɠe zɔiti ba, ti ʋilɛsu ɲiibiɠa, ti ɗa ɓɔɔle, è ti ʋu yɛ.» <verse eid="JDG 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6"/>Nui niiti ti ɠɛni ziɛi ɓɔlezu, ti seɠe ga yeei, ti to la, naati ti ɠɛni ga zunu unsaʋagɔ (300). Zɔiti kpein ti ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa, ti laaʋɛɛ ziɛi ɠa, ti ɗa kpɔle.<verse eid="JDG 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «Zunu unsaʋagɔi (300) niiti ti ziɛi ɓɔlea ga yeei, naati ka gè wo unmɔɔsu ga ti maaʋele, gè Madiyan nuiti dɔ wo yeezu. Nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ti ɠale ma ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu.» <verse eid="JDG 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8"/>Naa ʋolu, Zedeyɔn Izilayɛle zunuiti kpein gaaɠaleni ma, ɛsɛ ge li ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, é zunu unsaʋagɔ (300) nɔ makɛ, naati ma ti ta-laamianigiti seɠeni, ta ta-ʋuʋugiti. Tama Madiyan nuiti ti ɠɛni ʋuuni ti yeeɠɔɠɔwuʋɛ nɔ nɛmɛi zu.<verse eid="JDG 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zedeyɔn zili nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ nui ta <optbreak/> segi wo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9"/>Naama ɓidi ná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «Li, è laalɛ Madiyan nuiti bu ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai zu, mazɔlɔɔ gè ti lɔa è yeezu. <verse eid="JDG 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10"/>Ni ɗa luazu ga è yei ná, à yei ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai zu, wa ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui Pula. <verse eid="JDG 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11"/>Woilo, è naa mɛni nii ti bosu, naa ɠa è zɛbɛlɔ, ɗa yei naa ʋolu è laalɛ ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai wu.» Zedeyɔnni ti yeini ta ná-botiɠɛ nui Pula, naati ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai ma mɔungi ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="JDG 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12"/>Madiyan nuiti, ta Amalɛke nuiti, ta folo ɠulazu ʋele nuiti, ti vazaga ɠɛni de nɛmɛi zu, ti mɔin gola, eɠɛ kotogiti, nu la ɓena zoo é ʋa ta-ɲɔmɛiti gaalu, ti mɔinni eɠɛ kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ ɲaɠaegi.<verse eid="JDG 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13"/>Zedeyɔn zeeliai ma ná, wɛlɛ zunui ta ɠɛni segi zuɠulazu bɔɔlai ta ma. É ɠɛni ma: «Sèsuʋɛ, wɛlɛ wɔɔlezegi ma ɓului gila ge ɠilikilini, é li é loo Madiyan nuiti ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai zu, seeliai ma seɠe ɠotai ʋɔ bɛ, é loɠani maazuʋɛ ta buuʋɛ ʋa, é toka zooi ma.»<verse eid="JDG 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14"/>Bɔɔlai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ani ɠili nɔpɛ ta ga ná, kɛni Zoase ná-doun zunui Zedeyɔn ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi, Izilayɛle zunui, nii GALA ge zobogi veai bɛ, ga é pilɛ sɔlɔɔ Madiyan ma, ta ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti.»<verse eid="JDG 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15"/>Siɛgi zu Zedeyɔn segi zu wooi mɛnini da, ta poluwo gooi, é nɔkɔni, é ɠale ma Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai zu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À wuzeɠe, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zobogi vea wo ʋɛ, wo pilɛ sɔlɔɔ Madiyan nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti ma.»<verse eid="JDG 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16"/>Zedeyɔn zunu unsaʋagɔiti (300) gaaɠwɛɛni su saʋa, é puʋugi veeni kɔɔɠɔ nui ɠilagilagi pɛ zea, ta pɔlɔ liɠi zuɲakai, nii ti ɠɛni sɔmɔgi ɠaazosu, ti dɔ su. <verse eid="JDG 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa ɠɛ nɔ̀un pɛtɛsu, wo ɗa naa nɔ ɠɛ, nii gè kɛɛzu. Nà zeelina nɔ feya ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai ɠobaʋɛ, nii gè kɛɛzu, wo naa ɠɛ. <verse eid="JDG 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18"/>Siɛgi zu gè puʋugi vɛɛzu la, niiti kpein ti bà, wa puʋugi vɛ wa ɓalaagi ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai maaɠoolii zu, wo ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Zedeyɔn ʋɛ!› »<verse eid="JDG 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zobogi vee vai <optbreak/> Izilayɛle ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19"/>Zedeyɔn ta zunu ungilagiti (100) ti zeelini Madiyan nuiti ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai zu, aisa kua zaamai. Naati ti kɔɔlaaɠa maaɓɛɛ nuiti maavaliboni nɔ feya. Gaamago nɔ, Zedeyɔn ta ná-nuiti ti puʋugi vɛɛni, ti pɔlɔ liɠiiti golo, niiti ti ɠɛni zoni ti ya. <verse eid="JDG 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20"/>Ti-zeizu saʋagɔiti pɛ ti puʋugi ʋɛɛni, ti ta-ʋɔlɔ liɠiiti golo. Ti sɔmɔgi zoni ga ti-ɠɔʋɛi, puʋugi ɠɛ ti-yeezai ɠa, ti ɗa fɛ, ti ɗa kpeei loo, ti ɠɛ ma: «À sogi wo ga wa-woɠa zɔkpɔi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta Zedeyɔn ʋɛ!» <verse eid="JDG 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21"/>Ti ɠilagilagi pɛ ge yɛni loni losuʋɛ, kɔɔlaaɠai maaɠoolii zu, zunuiti kpein ti ʋelani ti ɠula kɔɔlaaɠai ʋa ga kpizɛi, ti ɗa kpeei loo. <verse eid="JDG 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22"/>Zunu unsaʋagɔi (300) ɠɛai ma puʋugi vɛɛzu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vaani bu, ga tɛiti ti ɠɛni kɔɔlaaɠai zu, ti ʋɛɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma ga boɠa zɔkpɔiti. Kɔɔlaaɠai zu nui mɔtaiti ti ɓizɛni, eyɛsu ti li Ɓɛte-Sita, ti li ga Selela ʋele, ti zeeli Aɓɛle-Meɠola taa wolai ʋɔ bɛ, Taɓate ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ɠɔɔɠɔ nui zɔiti <optbreak/> ti ʋaa vai kpɔbai ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23"/>Izilayɛle zunuiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, Nɛfɛtali geleiti, ta Asɛɛl ta Manasé geleiti, ti ʋilɛni Madiyan nuiti polu. <verse eid="JDG 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24"/>Zedeyɔn keelaiti teʋeni Efelayime ɠize yooi zu ná pɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: «À yei wo Madiyan nuiti daaɠomi, wo ziɛ leʋesuʋɛti so ti luɠɔ, eyɛsu Ɓɛte-Ɓala, ta Zuludɛn leʋesuʋɛti.» Ti Efelayime zunuiti kpein tolini, ti yeini ti ziɛ leʋesuʋɛti so, eyɛsu Ɓɛte-Ɓala, ta Zuludɛn leʋesuʋɛti. <verse eid="JDG 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25"/>Ti Madiyan nuiti ta-ɠundiɠi felegɔ zoni, Wolɛɓe ta Zeebe, ti Wolɛɓe ʋaani fasai ma, daasei pɛai ga Wolɛɓe vasai, ti Zeebe ʋaani dɔɔɓɔi kpɛtɛzuʋɛ, nii daasei pɛai ga Zeebe ná-dɔɔɓɔi kpɛtɛzuʋɛ. Ti ʋilɛni Madiyan nuiti polu, ti liini ga Wolɛɓe nɔungi, ta Zeebe nɔungi, ti fe Zedeyɔn ya, Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei, folo ɠulazu ʋelei.<verse eid="JDG 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8"/>
  <para style="s">Efelayime nuiti ta-yiiɠaawana vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1"/>Efelayime zunuiti ti ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «Leeni vaa ɠa è kɛai ga giye? Lee vaa zu è la gi lolini, è liizuʋɛ Madiyan nuiti sakpesu?» Ti laalɛɛni bu, ti ɓɔɛ gola.<verse eid="JDG 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2"/>Zedeyɔn ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa wola ɠa gè kɛai, nii nu a pokɔɠɔna wɔnɔ ɠɛai ma? Efelayime nuiti, wo-losuʋɛ wo naa ɠɛai, posuyɛʋɛi naa la wɔɔlɔni, é ʋa leʋe Aɓiyezɛɛl ná-pɛlɛyeɠei nɔnɔ ma lɔɔɓɔi kpɛtɛai ʋa? <verse eid="JDG 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3"/>Naa pɛ poluma, wa ɠa GALA ge Madiyan ɠundiɠiiti Wolɛɓe ta Zeebe lɔɔni wo yeezu. Lee ʋokɔɠɔma vaa ɠa gè kɛɛni ga woye naazu?» Zedeyɔn ná-gooɠaaʋotegi ti yiilɛini, ti zeɠe ziiɠaawanai ʋolu.<verse eid="JDG 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zobo sɔlɔɔ fai <optbreak/> Madiyan masagiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4"/>Zedeyɔn zeeliai ma Zuludɛn ma, ta zunu unsaʋagɔiti (300), ti maazuɓudɛni, ti wola ɓɔlɔai, kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni nɔ ti zili nuiti kpɛɛzu. <verse eid="JDG 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5"/>Zedeyɔnni seeliai ma Sukɔte taa wolai zu, é ɠɛni taaʋeaiti ma: «Nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu, à ɓulua ve zunuiti zea, niiti ti màazaasu, mazɔlɔɔ ti ɓɔlɔa, tama nà dɛ Zeɓa ta Salamuna ɓɛɛzu, niiti ti ga Madiyan masagiti.»<verse eid="JDG 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6"/>Sukɔte ɠundiɠiiti ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Leeni vaa zu gá daamianigi ve ɗa-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti zea? È yeeziɛ Zeɓa ta Salamunani bu, ɓaa ti lɔ è yeezu?»<verse eid="JDG 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni ti ma: «Ni é ɠɛa ɠana, siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Zeɓa ta Salamuna lɔɔzu la zèezu, nà wo zuvala ga teʋebai zu ɠaingiti ta ɠaingi ma zii pɛ.»<verse eid="JDG 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8"/>Zedeyɔn zeɠeni ná, é li Penuwele, é fali ɠilagi naa nɔ woni ma laaʋeaiti ma. Penuwele nuiti ti gooɠaaʋote gilagi naa nɔ woni da, nii Sukɔte nuiti ti boni la. <verse eid="JDG 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9"/>É ɠɛni Penuwele nuiti ma: «Siɛgi zu kɔɔi a ɓena la, nà ɠalena ma ziilɛigi zu, nà wa-laaʋeaiti ta-ʋɛlɛ ɠaaɠooza golai loka.»<verse eid="JDG 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10"/>Zeɓa ta Salamuna ti ɠɛni Kaalekɔɔl ta ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti, ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waapuugɔ maazu lɔɔlu (15.000). Naa nɔ ɠa é yɛni ti ya, folo ɠulazu ʋele nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti su zunu waaungila waaʋuufelegɔ (120.000) kpein ge zaani, niiti ti ɠɛni kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="JDG 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11"/>Zedeyɔn lɛɛni ga teʋeteʋe nuiti ta-ʋelei, Nɔɓa folo ɠulazu ʋelei ta Yogeɓeɠa, é liini é kɔɔlaaɠai zakpe, nii é laani ɓɔɠɔ la, maaɠili la ɠɛni ma. <verse eid="JDG 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12"/>Madiyan masa felegɔiti, Zeɓa ta Salamuna, ti ʋelani. Zedeyɔn ʋilɛni ti ʋolu, ti ti zo, dualuagi lɔɔni ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti su, ti vaza.<verse eid="JDG 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sukɔte ta Penuwele nuiti suloɠa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13"/>Zoase ná-doun zunui, Zedeyɔn zeɠezuʋɛ kɔɔmaʋɛ, é lɛɛni ga pelei, é gize yɔɠɔzuʋɛ Ɠelɛse. <verse eid="JDG 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14"/>É zunu loungoi ta zoni, Sukɔte nuiti saama, é gaazaɠa, naa Sukɔte ɠundiɠiiti ta kɛwolaiti daaseigi zɛʋɛni, é fe zea, ti ɠɛni ga zunu ʋuulɔfela maazu lɔfela (77). <verse eid="JDG 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15"/>Naa ʋolu, é ʋaani Sukɔte nuiti pɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À wɛlɛ Zeɓa ta Salamuna ʋa, niiti wo pòomuni ta-vaa zu, wo ɗa ɠɛ mà: ‹Zeɓa ta Salamuna ti lɔa è yeezu ɓaa, gi ʋa daamiani fe ɗa-nuiti zea, niiti ti ɓɔlɔai?› » <verse eid="JDG 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16"/>É Sukɔte taa ɠɛwolaiti soni, é teʋebai zu ɠaingiti kula, ta ɠaingi ma zii pɛ, é ti zuvala da. <verse eid="JDG 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17"/>É Penuwele taaʋeaiti ta-ʋɛlɛ ɠaaɠooza golai lokani ɓalaa, é zunuiti paa.<verse eid="JDG 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni Zeɓa ta Salamuna ma: «Zunuiti ti ɠɛni ɠale, niiti wo ti ʋaani Taɓɔɔl?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ti ɠɛni ga è ɠɛʋele, ti ɠɛʋelei ɠɛni eɠɛ masa dounɠa.»<verse eid="JDG 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni ti ma: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti kana, gi dee ma. Nà ɠonazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, ni wo ti yɛni vulua, wo la ti ʋaani, gè la ɓena wo ʋaa pɛ!» <verse eid="JDG 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20"/>É ɠɛni ná-doun zunu mɔungi Yetɛɛl ma: «Wuzeɠe, è ti ʋaa!» Kɛlɛ zunu loungoi la ɠɛni ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulani su, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni luazu, mazɔlɔɔ zunu loungoi nɔ ɠɛni de dɛ.<verse eid="JDG 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21"/>Zeɓa ta Salamuna ti ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «Wuzeɠe, è gi ʋaa ɗa ɓɔɠɔi! Mazɔlɔɔ ʋelei zunui la, zekana ná-zɛbɛi la!» Zedeyɔn wuzeɠeni, é Zeɓa ta Salamuna ʋaa. Naa ʋolu, é ta-ɲɔmɛiti kɔbu yɔlɔɠɔ ʋagɔiti seɠeni.<verse eid="JDG 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zedeyɔn ɠɛlɛ vai masadai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22"/>Izilayɛle zunuiti ti ɠɛni Zedeyɔn ma: «Zei ga masagi gi unda, ɗa zeɠena ná è-loun zunui, naa ʋolu è-lounloin, mazɔlɔɔ è gi ɠizoga gi ɠula Madiyan nuiti zea.»<verse eid="JDG 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè la zeizu wo unda ga masa, anɛɛ dòun zunui ʋe, ɓaa dòunloin. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é zeizu wo unda ga masagi.» <verse eid="JDG 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24"/>Zedeyɔn ɠɛni ti ma mɔnɔ: «Nà faa ɠila bosu wo ma ga wo kɛ: Wo ɠilagilagi zanu goizu anigi gila fe bɛ̀, aniiti su ti zogai kɔɔi zu.» Zanu goizu anigiti ti ɠɛni Madiyan nuiti zea, tɔɔzei ʋele ɠana teʋebai zu nuiti ti ɠɛni la.<verse eid="JDG 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Gá ti ve ga koozunɛ.» Ti seɠe wolai zuvieni, ɛsɛ ge ɗa goizu anigi ʋili su, é ɠula naa zu, nii é sogai kɔɔi zu. <verse eid="JDG 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26"/>Zanu goizu anigi Zedeyɔn sɔlɔɔni, ti pɛ buɲɛgi ɠɛni ga kilo ʋuufelegɔ (20). É kɔbu yɔlɔɠɔiti sɔlɔɔni ɓalaa, ta seɠe ɓɔi pagɔiti, niiti Madiyan masagiti ti ɓena too ɠɔba, ta yɔlɔɠɔ ʋagɔiti, ti ɠɛni ta-ɲɔmɛiti kɔbu. <verse eid="JDG 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27"/>Zedeyɔn zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei ɓɛtɛni la, nii é ga kakazu gelei, é daani ná-taazuʋɛ, Wofela. Miná ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni ná, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni nɔkɔsu bu. É ɠɛni ga balii Zedeyɔn ʋɛ ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei.<verse eid="JDG 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zedeyɔn zaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28"/>Madiyan ɠoloni Izilayɛle ʋɛ, ti la mɔ ungi wuzeɠeni pɛ. Zooi zeini ziilɛigi zu, kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu Zedeyɔn zii ma voloi pɛ su.<verse eid="JDG 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29"/>Zoase ná-doun zunui Yeluɓaale, nii é ga Zedeyɔn, ɠaleni ma, é zei ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="JDG 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30"/>Zedeyɔn doun zunu ʋuulɔfela (70) zɔlɔɔni, kpɔɠɔ gelei, mazɔlɔɔ anzai wola mɔinni. <verse eid="JDG 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31"/>Anzai Sikɛme, nii é la ɠɛni vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele, naa doun zunu ɠila sɔlɔɔni bɛ ɓalaa, é naa laasei pɛɛni ga Aɓimelɛke.<verse eid="JDG 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32"/>Zoase ná-doun zunui, Zedeyɔn zaani, kɛlɛ é pɔlɔzaɠagi woni undaanɛɛi zu. Ti maaɠuluni kɛɛɠɛ Zoase ná-kabayeɠei zu, Wofela taazuʋɛ, nii é ɠɛni ga Aɓiyezɛɛl ná-pɛlɛyeɠei nɔnɔi.<verse eid="JDG 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33"/>Siɛgi zu Zedeyɔn zaani la, Izilayɛle nuiti ti tɔɔzeini ga koloɠologi ɠɛa ta Ɓaaleni, ti Ɓaale-Ɓelite ɠɛni ga ta-ɠalagi. <verse eid="JDG 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti la ɠɛni ɠizɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zu, ta-ƓALAGI, nii é ti vieni, é ti ɠula ti zili nuiti kpein zeezu, niiti ti ɠɛni ti-maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="JDG 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35"/>Ti la ɠɛni nuɓɔɠɔlai wuuɠwɛɛni, ga tago nɔpɛ, é ʋa lo Zedeyɔn ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋa, nii é ga Yeluɓaale, faa ʋagɔi nii kpein é kɛɛni Izilayɛle letema.<verse eid="JDG 8:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9"/>
  <para style="s">Aɓimelɛke zei vai <optbreak/> ga masagi Sikɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1"/>Yeluɓaale, nii é ga Zedeyɔn, naa ná-doun zunui gila, nii é ga Aɓimelɛke, naa ɠa é liini kɛkɛni pɔ bɛ Sikɛme, é ɓɔɛ dee ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuɓusɛiti pɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="JDG 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2"/>«À Sikɛme nu wolaiti gaazaɠa, wo ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Leeni ɠa fizɔgai wo ma, Yeluɓaale ná-doun zunu ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) ti zei wo unda, ɓaa nu ɠila nɔ zei wo unda?› À ɠizɛ su ga wo ta ɠa ga ze, ada ga ɲama ɠilagi.»<verse eid="JDG 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3"/>Kɛkɛni ti liini ti naama wooiti daazeeli Sikɛme nu wolaiti kpein ma. Naati kpein ti ɠitoni Aɓimelɛke ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛni ma: «Gi ta ʋe.» <verse eid="JDG 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4"/>Ti wali ɠae ʋuulɔfela (70) veeni zea, ti seɠe Ɓaale-Ɓelite lɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu. Aɓimelɛke nu ɲakaiti ta teʋeteʋe nuiti seɠeni ga naama walii, ti ʋilɛ polu. <verse eid="JDG 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5"/>Naa ʋoluma, é liini kɛɛɠɛ ná-taazuʋɛ Wofela, é kɛɛɠɛ Yeluɓaale ná-doun zunu ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) paa, é ti pɛ paani kɔtu ɠilagi maazu. Kɛni Yotame ɠila kpe, Yeluɓaale ná-doun zunui, nii gola lɔini ti zu, naa la ɠɛni zaani, tɔɔzei é lɔɔɠuni. <verse eid="JDG 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6"/>Sikɛme nu wolaiti kpein ta Ɓɛte-Milo nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti Aɓimelɛke zei ga masagi, ti naa ɠɛni sɛne gului wu Sikɛme, zalaɠa ɠɔtu ɠaaɠoozagi ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yotame ná-faalaalii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7"/>Naa kpein ge woni Yotame ma. É liini é lo Galizime gizei unmaʋɛ, é ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ, é wooɠula la, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 9:7"/>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:7">À woilo gòo ma, Sikɛme nu wolaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:7">ni wa pɔ ga GALA ge wo woomɛni!<verse eid="JDG 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8"/>Gulu wolaiti ti liini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:8">ga ti gulɔi ziɛ masagi ma, é zei ti unda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:8">Ti ɠɛni wolive wului ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:8">«Zei gi unda ga masagi.»<verse eid="JDG 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9"/>Kɛlɛ wolive wului ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:9">«Gè ɓe mà waai ma wulɔi vee vai ʋa ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:9">nii ta ɗa GALA ta nuɓusɛiti dɛbi la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:9">gè li gè ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔlɔ ga gè zei guluiti unda?»<verse eid="JDG 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10"/>Guluiti ti ɠɛni naazu kooleɠoole gului ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:10">«Ʋa, è zei gi unda ga masagi!»<verse eid="JDG 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11"/>Kɛlɛ kooleɠoole gului ɠɛni ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:11">«Gè ɠɛlɛ mà nɛɛi ʋa, ta mà waa ʋagɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:11">gè li gè ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔlɔ ga gè zei guluiti unda?»<verse eid="JDG 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12"/>Guluiti ti ɠɛni leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:12">«Ʋa, ɗɔun è zei gi unda ga masagi.»<verse eid="JDG 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13"/>Kɛlɛ leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ɠɛni ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:13">«Gè ɠɛlɛ nà-dɔɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:13">nii é GALA ta nuiti koozunɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:13">gè li gè ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔlɔ ga gè zei guluiti unda?»<verse eid="JDG 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14"/>Názu ɠa guluiti kpein ti ɠɛni la ɠain ba wului ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:14">«Ʋa, è zei gi unda ga masagi.»<verse eid="JDG 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15"/>Ɠain ba wului ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:15">«Ni wo-yiimai ɠana, wo gulɔi ziɛ mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:15">wo kɛ̀ ga masagi wo unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:15">à ʋa wo lɔɔɠu mà niinigi wu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:15">Ni wa ɠɛlɛna, abui ɠa ɠula mà ɠaingiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 9:15">é Liɓan sɛdele guluiti gala.»<verse eid="JDG 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16"/>Yotame ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ: «Niizu deɠɛmu, kisiɛ ʋagɔi ɠa wo bogai nɛi, ta sɔledai, Aɓimelɛke zei vai zu ga masagi? Faa ʋagɔ ɠana nɛi wo kɛai Yeluɓaale ná-pɛlɛyeɠei letema? Wo unfemai veeʋɛ bɛ nɛi, é zoloo ná-kɛɛwoti ʋagɔiti ma, niiti é ti ɠɛɛni? <verse eid="JDG 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɛ̀ɛ kɔɔi ɠɔɔni wo ʋɛ, é ɠikulani zɛnvui zu kɔɔmaʋɛ, é wo ɠulani Madiyan nuiti zea. <verse eid="JDG 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18"/>Wɔun, wo wuzeɠea kɛ̀ɛ ná-pɛlɛyeɠei laalɔɠɔma za, wo ná-doun zunuiti paani, zunu ʋuulɔfela (70), kɔtu ɠilagi maazu. Wo ná-botiɠɛ anzanui ná-doun zunui Aɓimelɛke lo Sikɛme ga masagi, tɔɔzei toɠa ga wo-ɠɛɛloin. <verse eid="JDG 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19"/>Ni kisiɛ ʋagɔi ɠana wo bogai za, ta sɔledai, Yeluɓaale letema, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei, Aɓimelɛke wo yiima vai ɠɛ wo ʋɛ, wa ɓalaa wo ziima vai ɠɛ! <verse eid="JDG 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20"/>Ni naa laade, abu ɠila ka ɠula Aɓimelɛke zu, nii a Sikɛme nu wolaiti gala, ta Milo ʋɛlɛyeɠei, abu ɠila ka ɠula Sikɛme nu wolaiti su, ta Ɓɛte-Milo nuiti, nii a Aɓimelɛke ɠala!»<verse eid="JDG 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21"/>Yotame ʋelani é li é lɔɔɠu Ɓeel, miná ɠa é yɛni ná, é maaɠooza kɛɛɠɛloin Aɓimelɛke ʋa.<verse eid="JDG 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuiti ti wuzeɠe vai <optbreak/> Aɓimelɛke laalɔɠɔma Sikɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22"/>Aɓimelɛke ɠɛni ga kundiɠii Izilayɛle unda kona saʋagɔ laawu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23"/>Naa ʋoluma, GALA ge gooɠaaɠaalala yɛnvui lɔɔni Aɓimelɛke ta Sikɛme nu wolaiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti wuzeɠeni daalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="JDG 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24"/>tɔɔzei faa ɲɔi ʋa é kɛɛni ga Yeluɓaale ná-doun zunu ʋuulɔfelaiti (70), naa ɠa a kɛ ti-ma ɲamai la Aɓimelɛke unma, tɔɔzei ti-ɠɛɛloin ʋe, tɔ ɠa é ti ʋaani, Sikɛme nu wolaiti ti ɓɔ ba. <verse eid="JDG 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25"/>Nii a kɛ ti zoo Aɓimelɛke la, Sikɛme nuiti, ti nuiti seini gizeiti unmaʋɛ, ti ti lɔɔɠu taa wolai ɠobaʋɛ, naama zunuiti ti ɠɛni loozu nuiti ma, niiti ti ɠɛni leʋesu ti ɠobaʋɛ. Ma wooi woni Aɓimelɛke ma.<verse eid="JDG 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26"/>Yeeta, Eɓɛde ná-doun zunui Gaale, ta kɛɛɠɛlointi ti ɠɛni leʋesu Sikɛme. Sikɛme nu wolaiti kpein ti laani da. <verse eid="JDG 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27"/>Ti liini ta-leezɛn ɓeleiti su, ti ma waaiti kula, ti ti ɓɛtɛ, ti koozunɛ vɛti ɠula, ti li ta-ɠalagi ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti daamii wo, ti ɓɔɔle, ti Aɓimelɛke ɠoto. <verse eid="JDG 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28"/>Eɓɛde ná-doun zunui Gaale ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é ga Aɓimelɛke, ɓɛ ɠa é ga Sikɛme, gi ʋa botii ɠɛ Aɓimelɛke ʋɛ? Yeluɓaale ná-doun zunui laade ɓaa, Zeɓule laade é ʋa ɠɛ ga ná-keelai? À botii ɠɛ Ɠamɔɔl zunuiti bɛ, nii é ga Sikɛme kɛɛɠɛ. Gɔun, leeni vaa zu gá botii ɠɛ Aɓimelɛke ʋɛ? <verse eid="JDG 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29"/>Ni nui ta a niima nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠilai veena zèa! Nà la Aɓimelɛke maaɠooza. Nà la ɠɛ Aɓimelɛke ma: ‹Li è ta ɓɔ ɗa-zalaʋusuiti ba, è ʋa è kɔɔi ɠɔ!› »<verse eid="JDG 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30"/>Zeɓule nii é ɠɛni ga taai ma ɠundiɠii, naa mɛnini nii Gaale boni, Eɓɛde ná-doun zunui, gola yiiɠaawanani. <verse eid="JDG 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31"/>É keelaiti teʋeni dɔɔɠuzu Aɓimelɛke ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, Eɓɛde ná-doun zunui Gaale, ta kɛɛɠɛlointi ti ʋaaʋɛ Sikɛme, ti taai wuzeɠea è laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="JDG 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32"/>Kɛni niina è ɓaɠa ga kuai, wa nuɓusɛiti ti è ʋa, à lɔɔɠu ti ʋa ɓalaɠai zu. <verse eid="JDG 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33"/>Sobui, foloi a ɠulana, ɗa wuzeɠe è yei ti ma taa wolai zu. Siɛgi zu Gaale ta polu nuɓusɛiti ta wuzeɠena la è laalɔɠɔma, ɗa naa ɠɛ la, nii è-zɛbɛi a zoo da.»<verse eid="JDG 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34"/>Aɓimelɛke ta nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni polu, ti wuzeɠeni ga kuai, ti li ti lɔɔɠu Sikɛme ɠobaʋɛ, ti ɓɔɠɔ zeini su ga naanigɔ. <verse eid="JDG 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35"/>Eɓɛde ná-doun zunui, Gaale ɠulani, é lo taa ziɠidaʋɛ. Aɓimelɛke ta nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ɠɛni polu dɔɔɠu ʋelei zu, ti ɠulani kɛlɛma.<verse eid="JDG 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36"/>Gaale ti ɠaani, é ɠɛ Zeɓule ma: «Wɛlɛ nuɓusɛiti ba, ti gizei yeizu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zeɓule gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gizeiti ma niinigi ɠa è kaazu ga numaa ʋe.»<verse eid="JDG 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37"/>Gaale ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ: «Nuɓusɛiti be ti yeizu zou zaamaʋɛ, bɛbɛi ɠa ʋaazu ga ungaiziɛ sɛne gului ma ʋelei.»<verse eid="JDG 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38"/>Zeɓule gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-ɓɔɛzuɠula ʋagɔiti ta mini, ɗɛi è ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa é ga Aɓimelɛke, gi ʋa botii ɠɛ bɛ?› Nuɓusɛiti ta ga naa, è ɠɛni ti ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛsu? Liina niina è kɔɔi ʋɛɛ ba!»<verse eid="JDG 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39"/>Gaale loni Sikɛme nu wolaiti tuɠɔ, é kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Aɓimelɛke ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40"/>Aɓimelɛke ʋilɛni polu, é ʋela naa ʋa. Nu mɔinmɔin maawanani ti za, tanigaa ti looni, aisa ti ʋa zeeli taa ziɠidaʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41"/>Aɓimelɛke ɠwɛni Aluma. Zeɓule Gaale ɓɛɛni ta kɛɛɠɛleaiti, ti la zooni ti ʋa yɛ Sikɛme.<verse eid="JDG 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aɓimelɛke Sikɛme ɠoloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42"/>Poluma zobui, Sikɛme nuɓusɛiti ti ɠulani ɓalaɠai zu. Naa woni Aɓimelɛke ma, <verse eid="JDG 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43"/>é ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti seɠeni, é ti ɠaaɠwɛ su ga seizu saʋagɔ, é lɔɔɠu ɓalaɠai zu, ti pelei ɓɔun. É kaai ma ga nuɓusɛiti ta ɠulazu taa wolai zu, é wuzeɠeni ti laalɔɠɔma, é ti zakpe. <verse eid="JDG 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44"/>Aɓimelɛke ta nu zeizu liegɔi é polu, ti vazani, ti loni taa ziɠidaʋɛ, nu ɓulu felegɔiti ti ʋuuni naati kpein ma, niiti ti ɠɛni ɓalaɠai zu, ti ti zakpe. <verse eid="JDG 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45"/>É laalɛɛni taai wu, é luʋa loni ba folo ɠila ɲɛgɛlɛin. Yɔvɛlɛɛ é ʋa leɠa taai zo, é zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ paa ti ɠɛni ná. É taai lokani, é kpoloi vaza ná.<verse eid="JDG 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46"/>Siɛgi zu Migedale-Sikɛme nu wolaiti ti naa mɛnini da, ti ʋelani ti li ti lɔɔɠu zeɠei zu, ta-ɠalagi Ɓelite ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="JDG 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47"/>É woni Aɓimelɛke ma ga Migedale-Sikɛme nu wolaiti pɛ ti ɠaalɛɛni ba. <verse eid="JDG 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48"/>Aɓimelɛke lɛɛni Salamon gizei ma, ta nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni polu. É zoovɛi zeɠeni, é gulu ɓekegi leʋega, é kula ba, é da ɠɔma. Naa ʋolu, é ɠɛni polu nuɓusɛiti ma: «Wo naa ɠaa, nii gè kɛai, à suvilɛ wo kɛ, eɠɛʋelei gè kɛai la.» <verse eid="JDG 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49"/>Nuɓusɛiti kpein ɛsɛ ge gulu ɓeke gilagila teʋeni, ti ʋilɛ Aɓimelɛke ʋolu. Ti liini ti gulu ɓekegiti pu zeɠei laaʋɛ, ti abui lo ba, ti naa ɠala, ta nii kpein é ɠɛni ná. Zekana ti Migedale-Sikɛme taaʋeaiti kpein undaaʋilini la, nu waagila (1.000) kɛɠala ɠɛni de, zunuiti ta anzanuiti.<verse eid="JDG 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aɓimelɛke zaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50"/>Naa ʋoluma, Aɓimelɛke liini Teɓɛse. É laalɛɛni taai wu, é so. <verse eid="JDG 9:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51"/>Pɛlɛ ɠaaɠooza golai ɠɛni taa zaamaʋɛ, ʋɛ zunuiti ta anzanuiti ti ɠɛni lɔɔɠuzu ná, ta taa nu wolaiti. Ti daaɠuluni ɓɔɠɔ ma, ti lɛ kɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52"/>Aɓimelɛke ʋaani pɛlɛ ɠaaɠoozagi ʋɔ bɛ, ʋɛ ná ɠɛni ga ti-lɔɔɠuzuʋɛ, é laalɛɛni bu, é maaɓuɠa pɛlɛlaʋɛ ʋa, ga é abui lo ba. <verse eid="JDG 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53"/>Názu ɠa anzanui ta molo ziɠa ɠɔtui looni la Aɓimelɛke nɔungi zu, é nɔunkalagi wolowolo. <verse eid="JDG 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54"/>Gaamago nɔ, é zunu loungoi lolini, nii é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai zeɠezu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-woɠa zɔkpɔi ɠula su, è pàa, naa ɠa a kɛ ti mina ɗa ga ɠɛ ma: ‹Anzanu ɠa é paani.› » Zunu loungoi bɔɔni, é za. <verse eid="JDG 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55"/>Izilayɛle zunuiti ti kaai ma ga Aɓimelɛke za, ɛsɛ ge liini ná-taazu.<verse eid="JDG 9:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56"/>Ʋele ɠana GALA ge Aɓimelɛke ná-faa ɲɔi zalani la tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ma, nii é kɛɛni ga kɛɛɠɛ, tɔɔzei kɛɛɠɛloun ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) paa vai ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 9:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57"/>GALA ge Sikɛme nuiti ta-vaa ɲɔi ʋotokulani tiya ɓɔɠɔi ma. Ʋele ɠana Yeluɓaale ná-doun zunui Yotame ná-foovooi laazeelini la.<verse eid="JDG 9:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10"/>
  <para style="s">Tola ta Yayiil, <optbreak/> tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti Izilayɛle unda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1"/>Aɓimelɛke zaa ʋoluma, Pua ná-doun zunui Tola, nii é ɠɛni ga Dodo ná-dounloin, Isakaal ná-bolodai zu nui ta, naa ɠa é wuzeɠeni ga é Izilayɛle unmɔɔ. É ɠɛni zeini Samiil, Efelayime ɠize yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2"/>É ɠɛni Izilayɛle ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu saʋagɔ (23) laawu. Naa ʋoluma é zaani, ti maaɠuluni Samiil.<verse eid="JDG 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3"/>Yayiil Galaade nui ɠa é zeini potogi zu, ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle unda, kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu felegɔ (22) laawu. <verse eid="JDG 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4"/>Ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga puusaʋagɔ (30), ti ɠɛni zeizu soovale ʋuusaʋagɔiti (30) kɔma, taa ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ɠa é ɠɛni ti ya, ti ti-laaseigi ʋɛɛni ga Yayiil ná-taaiti, zaaɠaza naa nɔ ɠa é ti ʋa, ta ʋuuni Galaade yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5"/>Yayiil zaani, ti maaɠuluni Kamon.<verse eid="JDG 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amɔn nuiti ti Izilayɛle nuiti kpɔlɔ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni mɔnɔ. Ti Ɓaaleni dɛbini, ta Asetaateiti, ta Siili nuiti ta-ɠalagiti, ta Sidɔn nuiti ta-ɠalagiti, ta Moaɓe nuiti ta-ɠalagiti, ta Amɔn nuiti, ta Filisiti nuiti. Ti ɠɛlɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, ti la mɔ ɠɛni dɛbizu. <verse eid="JDG 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Izilayɛle ma, é ti ʋɔdi Filisiti nuiti ma, ta Amɔn nuiti. <verse eid="JDG 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8"/>É zo naama ɠonagi ma, eyɛsu kona puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18) laawu, ti Izilayɛle nuiti maanɔɠɔni, ti ti nimiza. Tɛiti ti ɠɛni Zuludɛn folo ɠulazu ʋelei, Amool nuiti ta-yooi zu Galaade. <verse eid="JDG 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9"/>Amɔn nuiti ti Zuludɛn ɓudɛni, ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Zuda ʋa, ta Ɓɛnzamɛn, ta Efelayime ʋɛlɛyeɠei. Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni kidaaʋili golai zu. <verse eid="JDG 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓainni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi kotoi ɠɛa è laalɔɠɔma, mazɔlɔɔ gi ɠɛlɛa è ʋa, gá-ƓALAGI, gi ɗa Ɓaaleni dɛbi.»<verse eid="JDG 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ma: «É zo Ezipete nuiti ma, é li Amool nuiti pɔ, ta Amɔn nuiti, ta Filisiti nuiti, <verse eid="JDG 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12"/>ta Sidɔn nuiti, ta Amalɛke nuiti, ta Maon nuiti, naati kpein ti wo nimizani, kɛlɛ siɛgi zu wo kpee looni la gòizu, gè la ɠɛni wo ɠizoni, gè ʋa wo ɠula ti ya ɓaa? <verse eid="JDG 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13"/>Kɛlɛ wa ya, wo ɠɛlɛni bà, wo ɗa gala kiligiti dɛbi. Naa ɠa é ba, gè la mɔ wo ɠizosu mɔnɔ. <verse eid="JDG 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14"/>À li wo kpeei loo gala kiligiti goizu, niiti wo yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, ti wo ɠizo wa-maanɔɠɔ ziɛgi zu!»<verse eid="JDG 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma: «Gi kotoi ɠɛa, gi zo, eɠɛʋelei è pɔ la. Kɛlɛ yiilɔɔ, è gi ɠizo za!» <verse eid="JDG 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16"/>Ti gala kiligiti kulani ɓɔɠɔ zaama, ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɠɛni vaani bu, ga Izilayɛle yɛ kpɔlɔi zu.<verse eid="JDG 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17"/>Amɔn nuiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai ʋu Galaade, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba ɓalaa, ti ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai ʋu Misepa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18"/>Nuɓusɛiti ta Galaade ɠundiɠiiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠani ga: «Zunui ɓɛ ɠa a laalɛ Amɔn nuiti bu? Toɠa ɠɛ ga Galaade nuiti kpein ta-ɠundiɠii.»<verse eid="JDG 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛfeté, <optbreak/> tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle unda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1"/>Galaade nui Zɛfeté ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠɔ nu wola. É ɠɛni ga koloɠolo anzanui ná-doun zunui, ti yɔɠɔzu ta zunui daa ɠɛni ga Galaade. <verse eid="JDG 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2"/>Zunui naa ɓɔɠɔ anzai ɓalaa ge zunu lointi sɔlɔɔni. Naati ti wɔɔlɔni, ti Zɛfeté ɓɛɛni pɛlɛyeɠei wu, ti ɠɛ ma: «È la pogani zɔlɔɔga gi-ɠɛɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ga anzanu ɠili ná-doun zunu.» <verse eid="JDG 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3"/>Zɛfeté ʋelani, é maaɠooza kɛɛɠɛleaiti ba. É liini é zei Tɔɓe yooi zu. Nu ɲakaiti ma ɓulugi ʋilɛni polu, ti ɗa siɛpolui wo.<verse eid="JDG 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa ʋoluma, Amɔn nuiti ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛni Izilayɛle ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5"/>Tɛi Amɔn nuiti ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛni Izilayɛle ʋa, Galaade ɠɛwolaiti ti liini, ti Zɛfeté loli Tɔɓe yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6"/>Ti ɠɛni Zɛfeté ma: «Ʋa è ɠɛ ga gá-ɠɔɔɠuluɓai, ade Amɔn nuiti sakpe.»<verse eid="JDG 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7"/>Zɛfeté Galaade ɠɛwolaiti gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo la ɠɛni wɔ̀inzeɠeni ɓaa, wo ʋa kpɛ̀, wo kùla kɛ̀ɛ ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋa? Lee vaa zu wo ʋaazu pɔ̀ niina, tɛi wo kidaaʋiligi zu ɓaa?»<verse eid="JDG 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8"/>Galaade ɠɛwolaiti ti ɠɛni Zɛfeté ma: «Naa mu ka é kɛai gi ʋaai è ʋɔ bɛ ʋolu niizu, è lo gi luɠɔ, è Amɔn nuiti sakpe, è ɠɛ ga gá-ɠundiɠii, è ɓɔ Galaade nuiti kpein ba.»<verse eid="JDG 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9"/>Zɛfeté Galaade ɠɛwolaiti gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wa liina ga ze ʋolu, gè Amɔn nuiti sakpe, ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI a ti lɔɔna zèezu, nà ɠa ga ɠɛ ga wa-ɠundiɠii.»<verse eid="JDG 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10"/>Galaade ɠɛwolaiti ti ɠɛni Zɛfeté ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ga zeelei, nii gi bosu gá ziɛ ga è-wooi.» <verse eid="JDG 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11"/>Zɛfeté ʋilɛni Galaade ɠɛwolaiti polu, ti li. Nuɓusɛiti ti yeeloni ba, ti kɛ ga kundiɠii, ta kɔɔɠuluɓai ɓɔɠɔ unda. Zɛfeté naa kpein suɠulani, nii ti zolooni ma ta kɛwolaiti, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu Misepa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛfeté ná-keela wooi leʋe fai <optbreak/> Amɔn nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12"/>Zɛfeté keelaiti teʋeni Amɔn masagi ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa é è ɠisu dàalɔɠɔma, è ʋaazu è ɗa kɔɔi ʋɛɛ nà-zooi ʋa?»<verse eid="JDG 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13"/>Amɔn nuiti ta-masagi keelaiti gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Toɠa ga Izilayɛle ɠulazuʋɛ Ezipete yooi ʋa, ti nà-zooi zeɠeni, é zo ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn ʋa, é li ziɛ wolai Yaɓɔke ʋɔ bɛ, é zeeli Zuludɛn ma nɛmɛi ma. À mináti fe zèa, ziilɛigi zu.»<verse eid="JDG 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14"/>Zɛfeté keelaiti teʋeni ʋolu ga niinɛ Amɔn nuiti ta-masagi ma, <verse eid="JDG 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15"/>ti liini ti ɠɛ ma: «Zɛfeté bogɛ ga: Izilayɛle la Moaɓe you zeɠeni, ɓaa Amɔn nuiti ta-you. <verse eid="JDG 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16"/>Tɔɔzei Izilayɛle lɛɛni é zeɠe Ezipete, é ziɛni ga teʋebai zu ʋelei, eyɛsu é zeeli Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ma, é zeeli Kadɛse. <verse eid="JDG 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17"/>Názu ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti keelaiti teʋeni la Edɔme masagi ma, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Soma gi leʋe ga ɗa-yooi zu ʋele.› Kɛlɛ Edɔme masagi la ɠɛni kɛɛni, é ʋa woilo. Ti ta leʋeni ɓalaa Moaɓe masagi ma, naa ɓalaa ɠɛlɛni. Izilayɛle nuiti ti yɛni Kadɛse.<verse eid="JDG 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18"/>«Ti ziɛni teʋebai zu, ti latini Edɔme yooi ma, ta Moaɓe yooi, ti ʋa ga Moaɓe yooi folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ti ʋuuni ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn ʋoluʋɛ, ti la lɛɛni Moaɓe yooi zu, mazɔlɔɔ Aalanɔn ɠa é ga Moaɓe you ɠwɛgi.<verse eid="JDG 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19"/>«Izilayɛle nuiti ti keelaiti teʋeni Amool nuiti ta-masagi Siɠon ma, Ɠɛsɛɓon masagi, ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Soma, gi ziɛ ɗa-yooi zu, gi leʋe, gi li ʋɛ gi liizu ná.› <verse eid="JDG 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20"/>Kɛlɛ Siɠon la ɠɛni wola laani Izilayɛle la, é ʋa va bu ga naa ʋa leʋe ná-zooi zu. É ná-nuɓusɛiti kpein gaalɛɛni ba, ti ti ɓɔun Yaɠase, ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛ ti ʋa.<verse eid="JDG 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Siɠon ta ná-nuɓusɛiti dɔɔni Izilayɛle yeezu, é pilɛ sɔlɔɔ ti ma. Izilayɛle zooi kpein soni, ʋɛ Amool nuiti ti ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="JDG 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22"/>Ti Amool nuiti ta-yooi kpein soni, é zo ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn ma, eyɛsu é zeeli ziɛ wolai Yaɓɔke ma, é zo teʋebai ma, é zeeli Zuludɛn ma.<verse eid="JDG 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23"/>«Niizu niina, ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Amool nuiti kpɛa ná-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle luɠɔ, ɗa pɔ è ti ɓɛ ná ɓaa? <verse eid="JDG 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24"/>Nii nɔpɛ ɗa-ɠalagi Kemɔse feezu è ya ga è so, è la naa zoga ɓaa? Nii kpein Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gá-ƓALAGI seizu gi luɠɔ ga gi seɠe, gi la naa zeɠea ɓaa? <verse eid="JDG 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25"/>È vizɔgɛ mu Ɓalake ʋa ɓaa, Sipɔɔl ná-doun zunui, Moaɓe masagi? É Izilayɛle zakpeni nɛi ɓaa, ɓaa é kɔɔ ʋɛɛni ba? <verse eid="JDG 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26"/>É ɠɛa ga kona unsaʋagɔ (300) Izilayɛle zeini Ɠɛsɛɓon, ta Alowɛɛl, ta taaiti ti ɠiliai ti ʋa, ta taa wolaiti kpein ti ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn laaʋɛ. Leeni vaa zu wo la ɠɛni ti ɠulani ti ya naama ziɛgi zu? <verse eid="JDG 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27"/>Nɔ̀un nà, gè la kotoba vaa nɔpɛ kɛɛni è laalɔɠɔma, ɗa ɠa è faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu ga ze, è kɔɔi ʋɛɛ vai nɔ̀un ba. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, tukpɔɠaaleʋe ƓALAGI, ɠɛ za ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle nuiti ta Amɔn nuiti zɔɠɔzu!»<verse eid="JDG 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28"/>Amɔn nuiti ta-masagi la ɠɛni woiloni naama wooiti ma, niiti Zɛfeté ɠɛni ti wosu ma.<verse eid="JDG 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛfeté ná-minazeɠegi <optbreak/> ta ná-pilɛ sɔlɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29"/>Naazu ʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui yeini Zɛfeté ma, é Galaade ta Manasé yooiti maazuɓudɛni, é leʋe Misepé Galaade yooi zu, seɠeai ma miná, é liini luɠɔ, é laalɛ Amɔn nuiti bu. <verse eid="JDG 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30"/>Zɛfeté minazeɠeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni gaamazu ɗa zobo feena bɛ̀, gè pilɛ sɔlɔɔ Amɔn nuiti ma, <verse eid="JDG 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31"/>nà nu mɔungi naa ve è ʋɛ, gè kula ga gala zalaɠai, nii a ɠula nà-pɛlɛi wu, é ʋa dàaɠomisu, nà zobo sɔlɔɔna Amɔn nuiti ma kɔɔi zu, gè ɠale ma.»<verse eid="JDG 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32"/>Zɛfeté leʋeni é li Amɔn nuiti daalɔɠɔma, é kɔɔi ʋɛɛ ti ʋa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti lɔɔni zeezu. <verse eid="JDG 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33"/>É ti wola zuɠoloɠoloni taa wola ʋuufelegɔ (20) zu, é zo Alowɛɛl, Minite ʋele, eyɛsu é zeeli Aɓɛle-Kelamime. Amɔn nuiti ti ɠoloni Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="JDG 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛfeté ná-doun anzanui ná-fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34"/>Zɛfeté ɠaleni ma ʋolu ná-pɛlɛi wu Misepa. Wɛlɛ, ná-doun anzanui ɠa é ɠulani, é daaɠomi ga tamadegiti ta kua wo faiti. Ná-doun ɠila kpegi ɠɛni de, zunu loun la ɠɛni zea, ɓaa anzanu loun. <verse eid="JDG 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35"/>É kaani nɔ feya, é ná-seɠeiti balini ga kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, dòun anzanu! È kpɔ̀lɔa, ɗa màanɔɠɔ nuiti saama! Gè minazeɠe bogɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, gè la zeɠea nà-minazeɠegi ʋolu.»<verse eid="JDG 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Kɛ̀ɛ, ni è minazeɠe boga, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, nii kulaai è-laaʋɛ, è bo, naa ɠɛ ga ze, niizu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɗɔnɔ ʋotokula è zili nuiti ma, Amɔn nuiti.» <verse eid="JDG 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37"/>É ɠɛni kɛɛɠɛ ma: «Faa ɠila ka gè falizu è ma, è kɛ bɛ̀, alu felegɔ ve bɛ̀, gè li ga bɔ̀ɔlaiti gizei ma, gi nà-kpea wɔlɔi wo.»<verse eid="JDG 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38"/>Zɛfeté gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Li!» É valini ma ga alu felegɔ. É liini gizei ma, ta bɔɔlaiti, ti ná-kpea wɔlɔi wo. <verse eid="JDG 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39"/>Alu felegɔi ʋoluma, é ɠaleni ma kɛɛɠɛ ʋɔ bɛ, naama ge ná-minazeɠegi laazeelini la. É la ɠɛni dɛ zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Naama yeei ɠa ma lɔgi zeini la Izilayɛle zaama ga, <verse eid="JDG 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40"/>kona-o-kona, Izilayɛle anzalopoiti ti ɗa li, ti wɔlɔ ga folo naanigɔ Zɛfeté ná-doun anzanui ná-faa zu, nii é ga Galaade nui.<verse eid="JDG 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12"/>
  <para style="s">Zii ɠɔɔi Efelayime ta Galaade yɔɠɔzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1"/>Efelayime wolodai ma zunuiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ti Zuludɛn ɓudɛ, ti li Safon, ti ɠɛni Zɛfeté ma: «Leeni vaa zu è leʋegai, è li, è kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Amɔn nuiti ba, è la gi lolini, gi ʋa ʋilɛ è ʋolu? Gá pɔ gi ɗa-ʋɛlɛi ɠala, gi è ɓɔ ba, è ɠala.»<verse eid="JDG 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2"/>Zɛfeté ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Kpɔɛ wola ɠa é ɠɛa loni gi ʋa gá nà-nuɓusɛiti, é lo gi yɔɠɔzuʋɛ ʋa gá Amɔn nuiti. Siɛgi zu gè wo lolini la, ga wo ʋa wo ɓɔ bà, wo la ʋaani wo ʋa ɓɔ bà, wo ʋa kùla ti ya. <verse eid="JDG 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3"/>Siɛgi zu gè kaani la ga gè la zooga ɠitosu wo ʋa, gè ɠikulani zɛ̀nvui zu, gè liini nà ɠila, gè Amɔn nuiti sakpe. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti lɔɔni zèezu. Lee vaa zu za wo ʋaazu dàalɔɠɔma, ga wo kɔɔ ʋɛɛ bà?»<verse eid="JDG 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4"/>Efelayime nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu: «Wa ya, Galaade nuiti, wa ga Efelayime nuiti ti ʋelaai, ti li Manasé.» Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, Zɛfeté Galaade zunuiti kpein gaalɛ ba, é kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Efelayime nui naati ba, ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔ ti ma. <verse eid="JDG 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5"/>Galaade nuiti ti Zuludɛn maaleʋesuʋɛti soni Efelayime letemaʋɛ. Pela nuiti ti ɠɛni zeɠezu Efelayime, naa ta a la ɠɛna: «Nà pɔ gè leʋe,» Galaade nuiti ti ɠɛni gaazaɠasu, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ga Efelayime nuiti ta?» A la ɠɛna ti ma: «Ɓa-o,» <verse eid="JDG 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6"/>ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ɗa ɠɛ ‹Siɓɔlɛte.› » É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu «Ziɓɔlɛte,» mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠɛni zoosu ti ʋa bo ga pagɔ. Naa ɠa é ɠɛni kɛɛzu, Galaade zunuiti ti ɠɛni ti zosu, ti ɗa ti ɠɔdaaleʋe Zuludɛn maaleʋesuʋɛ. Efelayime zunuiti ti undaaʋilini naama vai zu, é ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuunaani maazu fele (42.000).<verse eid="JDG 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7"/>Zɛfeté ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu kona dɔzita laawu. Naa ʋoluma Galaade nui Zɛfeté zaani, ti maaɠuluni Galaade laa wolai ta zu.<verse eid="JDG 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iɓesan ta Elon ta Aɓedon, <optbreak/> tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8"/>Tɔun poluma, Ɓɛteleyɛme nui Iɓesan ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9"/>É doun zunu ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) zɔlɔɔni, ta doun anzanu ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), é ti veeni Izilayɛle wolodama ɠiligiti bɛ ga anzai, é anzanuiti fuluni ná-doun zunuiti bɛ, ti ɠula Izilayɛle wolodama ɠiligiti su. É ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu, kona dɔfela laawu. <verse eid="JDG 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10"/>Naa ʋolu, Iɓesan zaani, ti maaɠulu Ɓɛteleyɛme.<verse eid="JDG 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11"/>Tɔun poluma, Zaɓulɔn nui Elon ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu kona puugɔ laawu. <verse eid="JDG 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12"/>Saai ma, ti maaɠuluni Ayalon, Zaɓulɔn yooi zu.<verse eid="JDG 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13"/>Tɔun poluma, Aɓadon, Pilaton nui Ɠilɛle ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14"/>É doun zunu ʋuunaanigɔ (40) zɔlɔɔni, ná-dounloin ɠɛni ga puusaʋagɔ (30), ti ga zunuiti, ti pɛ ti ɠɛni zeizu soovale ʋuulɔfela (70) ɠɔma. É ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu kona dɔsaʋa laawu. <verse eid="JDG 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15"/>Naa ʋolu, Pilaton nui Ɠilɛle ná-doun zunui Aɓadon zaani, ti maaɠulu Pilaton, Efelayime yooi zu, Amalɛke nuiti ta-ɠize yooi zu.<verse eid="JDG 12:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13"/>
  <para style="s">Samesɔn zɔlɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni mɔnɔ. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti lɔɔni Filisiti nuiti zeezu kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu.<verse eid="JDG 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni Soleya, Dan ná-bolodai zu, daa ɠɛni ga Manoa. Anzai ɠɛni ga doun zɔlɔɔtala nui, é la ɠɛni zooni é ʋa doun zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="JDG 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3"/>Foloi ta, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠulani kɛlɛma anza nui naa ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, ɗa ga doun zɔlɔɔtala anzai, è la dɛ doun zɔlɔɔni, ɗa kogi zeɠezu, kɛlɛ è doun zunu zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="JDG 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4"/>Niizu, dama ga ɓɔɠɔ, mina dɔɔ ɓɔle, ɓaa ani nɔpɛ a nu ɠaazulati, ta è mina ani mi, nii kɔzɔai. <verse eid="JDG 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ʋaazu kogi zeɠezu, è doun zunu zɔlɔɔ. Doungoi naa ɠa yɛsu dee ɠoozu, é ɠaliva GALA ma, eyɛsu pɛ, maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa nɔungi wo, ɓaa kpɛlɛi. Toɠa a tɔɔzei ga Izilayɛle ɠula Filisiti nuiti zeezu.»<verse eid="JDG 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6"/>Anzanui liini ná-koizu, é ɠɛ sinigi ma: «GALA nui ta ʋaaʋɛ pɔ̀ bɛ, é ɠɛa ɠulani ga GALA ná-geezuɠeelai ta, gaamazu maayikiʋɛ. Gè la gaazaɠani ga ʋɛ seɠeai ná, ta é la laasei dɛɛni ga ze. <verse eid="JDG 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7"/>Kɛlɛ kɛɛʋɛ mà: ‹Wɛlɛ, ɗa ʋaazu kogi zeɠezu, è doun zunu zɔlɔɔ. Niizu mina dɔɔ ɓɔle, ɓaa gaazulati gani, ta mina ani mi, nii kɔzɔai, tɔɔzei doungoi naa yɛgɛ dee ɠoozu, é ɠaliva GALA ma, eyɛsu saa voloi zeeli.› »<verse eid="JDG 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8"/>Manoa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI valini, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, Màliɠii, GALA nui è teʋeni, é ʋaana mɔnɔ gi ʋɔ bɛ, é gi ɠala ga nii maanɛai gi kɛ doungoi ná-fai zu, nii é zɔlɔɔsu!»<verse eid="JDG 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9"/>GALA ge Manoa wooi mɛnini, GALA ná-geezuɠeelai ʋaani mɔnɔ anzanui ʋɔ bɛ, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni zeini la kpalagaʋɛ, sinigi Manoa la ɠɛni ba ná. <verse eid="JDG 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10"/>É suvilɛni é ɓizɛ, é li, é bo sinigi ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, zunui nii é ʋaani pɔ̀ bɛ zɔizu, é ɠula kɛlɛma bɛ̀ mɔnɔ.»<verse eid="JDG 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11"/>Manoa wuzeɠeni, é ʋilɛ anzai ʋolu, ti li zunui ʋɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ naa ma: «Ɗa ɠa nɛi è ɓɔɛai anzanui nii ʋɔ?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ʋe.»<verse eid="JDG 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12"/>Manoa ɠɛni ma: «Niizu è-laawooi a ʋilɛna su, tɔgi ɓɛgele ɠa gá so doungoi ná-faa zu, leeni ɠa gá kɛ?»<verse eid="JDG 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «È-anzai maanɛɛʋɛ é ɓɔɠɔ zo naa pɛ su, nii gè boni ma. <verse eid="JDG 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14"/>É mina leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ma waai mi, é mina dɔɔ ɓɔle, ɓaa gaazulati gani, é mina ani nɔpɛ mi, nii kɔzɔai, é ziɛ ga devei naa, eɠɛʋelei gè boni ma la.»<verse eid="JDG 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15"/>Manoa ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ma, naazu: «Va bu gi è zuzo, gi boli yiʋo ɠila kpɛtɛ è ʋɛ.»<verse eid="JDG 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Anɛɛ ni ɗa sùzosu, gè la ɗa-laamianigi ta mia, kɛlɛ ni ɗa pɔ è gala zalaɠai ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naa ɠɛ!» Manoa la ɠɛni kwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ʋe.<verse eid="JDG 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17"/>É geezuɠeelai ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «È-laaseigi? Naa ɠa a kɛ, nii è bogai, naa laa a zeelina, gi zoo gi è wɔɔlɔ.»<verse eid="JDG 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu è gàazaɠasu dàaseigi ma? Daasei be maayikiai.»<verse eid="JDG 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19"/>Manoa boli yiʋoi zeɠeni, é kpɔ vebɛ zalaɠai ʋa, é gala zalaɠa ɠula kɔtu wolai ma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Laavɔɔ vaa ɠɛɛni, siɛgi zu Manoa ta anzai ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu la, <verse eid="JDG 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20"/>abuzogi ɠɛni lɛɛzu geezu ʋelei, é ɗa zeɠe zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai lɛɛni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma abuzogi zu. Manoa ta anzai ti naa ɠaai ma, ti looni zooi ma, ti laaʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai la mɔ ɠɛni ɠulani kɛlɛma Manoani bɛ ta anzai. Manoa kwɛɛni naazu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni de.<verse eid="JDG 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22"/>Manoa ɠɛni anzai ma: «Da zaazu ti, mazɔlɔɔ de GALA kaa.»<verse eid="JDG 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23"/>Anzai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni pɔ ga é de ʋaa, é la ɓena da-vebɛ zalaɠai ta gala zalaɠai zo, é la ɓena naama vaiti kpein dɛɛ ga deye, é la ɓena naama vaiti kpein bo de ma.»<verse eid="JDG 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24"/>Anzanui doun zunu zɔlɔɔni, é daasei pɛɛ ga Samesɔn. Doungoi wɔɔlɔni, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya looni bɛ. <verse eid="JDG 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui tɔɔzeini ga botii ɠɛa la Maɠané-Dan, Soleya ta Esetawɔle ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14"/>
  <para style="s">Samesɔn Filisiti anzanui vulu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1"/>Foloi ta, Samesɔn yeini Timina, é Filisiti nuiti ta-anzalopoi ta ɠaani. <verse eid="JDG 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2"/>É ɠalegai ma ma, é boni kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè anzanui ta ɠaaʋɛ Timina, Filisiti anzalopoiti saama, à li wo naa vulu bɛ̀ ga anza.»<verse eid="JDG 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3"/>Kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ti ɠɛni ma: «Anzanu la è-ɠɛɛleaiti ti-loun anzanuiti saama ɓaa, ta da-nuɓusɛiti kpein, è liizu anzanu zeɠezu Filisiti nuiti pɔ bɛ, naama latipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Samesɔn ɠɛni kɛɛɠɛ ma: «À naa zeɠe bɛ̀, mazɔlɔɔ naa zoloogɛ mà.»<verse eid="JDG 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4"/>Kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ti la ɠɛni kwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é loni naama vaiti untuɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ naa ɠɛni kpɔɛ ɠeleɠele gaiziɛzu é lo Filisiti nuiti ba. Naama ziɛgi zu Filisiti nuiti ka ti ɠɛni zeini Izilayɛle nuiti unda.<verse eid="JDG 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5"/>Samesɔn yeini Timina ta kɛɛɠɛni ta dee, ti zeelini leezɛn ɓelei ʋɔ bɛ, gaamago nɔ zala ɓokpagi ɠulani, é ɗa zikɔ, é daaɠomi. <verse eid="JDG 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui yeini Samesɔn ma, zea ɲakai, é zalai zoni, é bali ga, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɗa boli yiʋoi ʋali ga la. Kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni naa woni kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ma. <verse eid="JDG 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7"/>É yeini é ɓɔɛ anzanui ʋɔ, naa ná-fai wola nɛɛni bɛ.<verse eid="JDG 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8"/>Foloi tanigaani teʋegai ma, é ɠaleni ma ga é li é vului ɠɛ, é zeɠeni pelei ʋa, é li é zalai ma ʋoomai ʋɛtɛ. É kɔingiti kaani, ti zalai ma ʋoomai zu, ta kɔin gulɔi. <verse eid="JDG 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9"/>É ta zeɠeni ya, é ɗa ziɛ, é ɗa kɔmɔ pelei zu. Siɛgi zu é zeelini la kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ʋɔ bɛ, é ta veeni ti ya, naati ti ta miini. Kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni boni ti ma ga é kɔin gulɔi ɠulani zala ʋoomai zu.<verse eid="JDG 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samesɔn faalaalii wo fai <optbreak/> Filisiti nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10"/>Samesɔn kɛɛɠɛ yeini anzanui ʋɔ bɛ. Samesɔn vulu vai ma laaɠolii woni, mazɔlɔɔ zekana nu niinɛiti ti ɠɛni kɛɛzu la. <verse eid="JDG 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11"/>Ti kaai ma, ti yeeloni nu ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ʋa ga ná-siɛpoluiti, ti ɠɛ ba.<verse eid="JDG 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12"/>Samesɔn ɠɛni ti ma: «Nà faalaalii ta wosu wo ma. Ni wa poluwona mà, aisa fɛtii ma volo lɔfelai ʋa ɓe, nà seɠewuzeɠe ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ve wo ya, ta seɠe wola ʋuusaʋagɔ (30). <verse eid="JDG 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13"/>Kɛlɛ ni wo la zooni wo ʋa poluwo mà, wa ɠa wa seɠewuzeɠe ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ve zèa, ta seɠe wola ʋuusaʋagɔ (30).»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa-vaalaalii wo, gi mɛni.»<verse eid="JDG 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14"/>É ɠɛni ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">«Nii é mii wosu, nu laamianigi ɠulaʋɛ naa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">Nii suɓaai, nɛɛ gelei ɠulani naa zu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:14">Folo saʋagɔ laawu, nu niinɛiti ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa faalaalii ʋoluwo. <verse eid="JDG 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15"/>Foloi naanisiɛi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Foloi naanisiɛi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai zu, naa ɠa ga: </char><char style="fqa">foloi lɔfelasiɛi</char>.</note> ti ɠɛni Samesɔn anzai ma: «È-zinigi nɛɛnɛso, é faalaalii ʋoluʋɛ wo è ma, è ʋa è bo gi ma, ni naa laade, gá è ɠalazu, ɗa-o, ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei-yo. Wo gi loligɛ ga wo loo gi zu ɓaa?»<verse eid="JDG 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16"/>Samesɔn anzai tɔɔzeini ga wɔlɔa daalɔɠɔma, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «È la nɛ̀ɛni ʋɛ! Wɔ̀in la è ma! È faalaalii woga nà-zou zu nuiti ma, è la poluʋɛ lɛɛni ga ze!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ma: «Gè la poluwoni kɛ̀ɛ ma, anɛɛ dèe ɓalaa, ɗa ɠa ga poluwo è ma?»<verse eid="JDG 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17"/>É ɠɛni wɔlɔzu goizu fɛtii ma volo lɔfelaiti kpein daawu, foloi lɔfelasiɛi é faalaalii ʋoluʋɛ woni ma, mazɔlɔɔ anzanui ɓɔini da. Naa liini gaamanɔ é bo ná-nuɓusɛiti ma.<verse eid="JDG 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18"/>Foloi lɔfelasiɛi, aisa foloi ʋa da, taazuʋɛ nu niinɛiti ti ɠɛni Samesɔn ma: «Leeni ɠa ɲɛmigai kɔin gulɔi ʋa, ɓɛ ɠa suɓaai zalai ʋa?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ni wo la ɠɛni wozai wolini ga nà-nikɛ zaai, wo la ɓena gooɠaaʋote sɔlɔɔ.»<verse eid="JDG 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui yeini ma, é yeini Asekalɔn. É zunu ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ʋaani, é ta-zɔɔlaiti seɠeni, é seɠe wolaiti feeni naati zea, niiti ti faalaalii ʋoluʋɛ woni. Naa ʋolu, gola yiiɠaawanai ɠa é ɠaleni ma la kɛɛɠɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="JDG 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20"/>Ti Samesɔn anzai veeni zunu loungoi naa ya, nii é ɠɛni ga bɔɔlai vulu vai zu.<verse eid="JDG 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15"/>
  <para style="s">Samesɔn potokulai wo fai <optbreak/> Filisiti nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa leʋegai ma, moloi é ga ɓeleegi, naa leʋe ziɛgi zu, Samesɔn liini laaliizu anzai ma ga boli yiʋoi, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nà lɛɛzu ànzai ná-pɛlɛi wu.» Kɛlɛ anzai kɛɛɠɛ la ɠɛni kɛɛni, é ʋa lɛ ná.<verse eid="JDG 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2"/>Naa ɠɛni ma: «Gè ɠɛa laani da ga wɔin la è ma, gè fea è-wɔɔlai ya ga anza. Deɠe anzanui la ʋani, é ʋa leʋe tɔun ba ɓaa? Naa zeɠe tɔun potogi zu.»<verse eid="JDG 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3"/>Samesɔn ɠɛni ti ma: «Niizu gè la mɔ ɠɛa ga sɔba nu Filisiti nuiti ta-vaa zu, ni nà faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛna ga tiye.» <verse eid="JDG 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4"/>Samesɔn liini, é koʋe unsaʋagɔ (300) zo, é felefelegiti wɔɔngiti gili ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, é sɔmɔgi ɠili ti-wɔɔn felegɔiti saama. <verse eid="JDG 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5"/>É abui loni sɔmɔgiti ba, é yeeɓe koʋeiti ba, ti ʋilɛ Filisiti nuiti ta-moloiti su, nii é ga ɓeleegi, ma ɠiliiti ta ma mɔɔiti ti ɠala, ta wolive ɓeleiti.<verse eid="JDG 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6"/>Filisiti nuiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é niima vai ɠɛai?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:6">Ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Samesɔn ʋe, Timina nui nɛkoi, tɔɔzei naa anzai zeɠeʋɛ, é fe bɔɔlai ya ga anza.» Filisiti nuiti ti liini, ti anzanui naa ɠala, ta kɛɛɠɛ.<verse eid="JDG 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7"/>Samesɔn ɠɛni ti ma: «Zekana wo kɛɛzu la ɓaa? Gè la mɔ looɠoga eyɛsu gè nɔnɔ ʋotokula wo ma.» <verse eid="JDG 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8"/>É laalɛɛni ti wu, é ti zuloɠani gola. Naa ʋolu, é li é zei Etame pugi zu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samesɔn vee vai <optbreak/> Filisiti nuiti zea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9"/>Filisiti nuiti ti liini ti ʋu Zuda yooi zu, ti vaza Leyi ʋele. <verse eid="JDG 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10"/>Zuda nuiti ti gaazaɠagi woni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu wo lɛai gi laalɔɠɔma?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Gi ʋaaʋɛ ga gi Samesɔn ɠili, gi naa ʋotokula, nii é kɛai ga giye.»<verse eid="JDG 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, Zuda yooi zu zunu waasaʋagɔ (3.000) liini Etame pugi zu, ti ɠɛ Samesɔn ma: «È la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa ga Filisiti nuiti ta zeini ade unda? Leeni ɠa è kɛai ga giye?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè ti zogɛ, eɠɛʋelei ti sògai la.»<verse eid="JDG 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Gi ʋaaʋɛ gi è ɠili, naa ʋolu gi è ve Filisiti nuiti zea.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samesɔn ɠɛni ti ma: «À ɠona bɛ̀, ga wo la pàa wa ɓɔɠɔi.»<verse eid="JDG 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o, gá pɔ nɔ ga gi è ɠili, gi è leʋe ti ʋɔ, kɛlɛ gi la è ʋaazu.» Ti gilini ga galu niinɛ felegɔ, ti kula pugi zu. <verse eid="JDG 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14"/>Siɛgi zu ti zeelini la Leyi, Filisiti nuiti ti kpeei looni ga koozunɛɛi, ti daaɠomi. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui yeini Samesɔn ma gaamanɔ. Galuiti ti ɠɛni zee ʋa, naati ti ɠɛni eɠɛ gezei, nii abui galaai, gili ɠaluiti pɛ ti ʋuuni ya, ti ɠula zee ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15"/>É soovalegi kpalɔɠae niinɛi ɠaani, é yeemaaleni, é seɠe, é zunu waagila (1.000) paani ga naa.<verse eid="JDG 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16"/>Samesɔn ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">«Gè poomaiti gaalɛ ba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">ga soovale kpalɔɠae ɠilagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">ungo gè zunu waagila (1.000) paa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">ga soovale kpalɔɠae ɠilagi.»<verse eid="JDG 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17"/>Siɛgi zu é ɓeni la ga ɓɔɛ, é soovale kpalɔɠaei ʋilini ya. Ti naama adaʋɛ laasei pɛɛni ga Lamate-Leyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Lamate-Leyi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi nii poluʋɛ ga «kpalɔɠae ɠizei».</char></note><verse eid="JDG 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18"/>Kpɔɔle wɔin wola ɓɔini da, é wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è kizo faa wolai nii ɠɛai ga zèei, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, niizu nà ga za ga kpɔɔle wɔin, nà ga loo tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti zeezaama?» <verse eid="JDG 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19"/>Gaamanɔ, GALA ge kɔtui ma yeɠei laalaoni, nii é Leyi, ziɛi ɠulani ná. Samesɔn ɓɔɔleni, ziilɛi tɔɔn, é zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔ ʋolu. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni ti ziɛungi naa laasei pɛɛni ga En-Ɠakole,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">En-Ɠakole</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi nii poluʋɛ ga «tolibo nui ná-ziɛungi».</char></note> naa ná-ziɛungi, toɠa dɛ ná zaaɠaza Leyi.<verse eid="JDG 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20"/>Samesɔn ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu, Filisiti nuiti ta-ziɛgi zu kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) laawu.<verse eid="JDG 15:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16"/>
  <para style="s">Samesɔn ná-fai Gaza taazuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1"/>Samesɔn liini Gaza taazuʋɛ, é koloɠolo anzanui ta ɠaani ná, é lɛɛni naa ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="JDG 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2"/>Ti ɠɛni Gaza nuiti ma: «Samesɔn zeeliʋɛ taazuʋɛ.» Ti nu ɠulazuʋɛ kpein makɛni kpidii, ti ɗa maaɓɔun taa ziɠidaʋɛ. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ti ɠaalɛini kpidii ɲɛgɛlɛin, ti deve ga ti paa sobui.<verse eid="JDG 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3"/>Samesɔn yɛni laani dɔin eyɛsu kua zaamai. Kua zaamai, é wuzeɠeni, é taai ma ziɠigi ma ɓo sɛʋɛiti soni ta daamasa felegɔiti, é kpo sɔɠɔgi ʋa, é ti pɛ pu ɠɔma, é li ga tiye gize unmaʋɛ Eɓelɔn letemaʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dalila Samesɔn yaava vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4"/>Tago zuɠoozaai ma, Samesɔn anzanui ta nɛɛni ʋɛ, nii daa ɠɛni ga Dalila, é ɠɛni zeini Solɛke nɛmɛi zu. <verse eid="JDG 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5"/>Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti liini naa ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: «Nɛɛnɛso dɛɛ, è kwɛɛ ʋɛ ná-zɛbɛ wolai zeɠezu ná, ta ʋelei ga zobo sɔlɔɔ da ma, gá gilizu, gi vɔni ma, gi ɠilagilagi ɠa wali ɠae waagila ungila (1.100) fe è ya.»<verse eid="JDG 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6"/>Dalila ɠɛni Samesɔn ma: «Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, ʋɛ ɗa-zɛbɛ wolai zeɠezu ná, soma è ná lɛ ga ze, ta leeni ɠa nu a è ɠili la, nu vɔni è ma.»<verse eid="JDG 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7"/>Samesɔn gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni nu a gìlina ga mɛɛn galu niinɛ lɔfela, niiti ti la dɛ vɔɔni, zɛbɛi ɠa ɠula zèa, nà ɠɛ nɔ eɠɛ nui mɔtaiti kɛʋele.»<verse eid="JDG 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8"/>Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti ʋaani ga mɛɛn galu niinɛ lɔfelaiti Dalila ʋɔ, niiti ti la ɠɛni dɛ vɔɔni. É gilini ga naati. <verse eid="JDG 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9"/>Kɛlɛ ti nuiti dɔɔɠuni koba pɛlɛi wu. Anzanui ɠɛni ma: «Filisiti nuiti ta ga è zo, Samesɔn!» É mɛɛn galui naati suleʋeleʋeni eɠɛ nɔ geze vuɓe ga ɠala abu ɠa. Ná-zɛbɛi zeɠezuʋɛ la ɠɛni ɠwɛɛni.<verse eid="JDG 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10"/>Dalila ɠɛni Samesɔn ma: «Wɛlɛ, è gàaɓoloɠazu, zɛɛiti ka è ti woga mà. Niizu nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, soma è naa lɛ ga ze, nii nu ɠa è ɠili la.»<verse eid="JDG 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Ni ta gìlina ga galu wɔɛn niinɛiti, ti la dɛ botii ɠɛɛni ga tiye, zɛbɛi ɠa ɠula zèa, nà ɠɛ nɔ eɠɛ nui mɔtaiti kɛʋele.»<verse eid="JDG 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12"/>Dalila galu wɔɛn niinɛiti seɠeni, é gili ga tiye. Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛ ma: «Filisiti nuiti ta ga è zo, Samesɔn!» Nuiti ma ti ɠɛni loni koba pɛlɛwuʋɛ. Kɛlɛ galuiti ti ɠɛni zeei ʋa, é ti leʋeni ga eɠɛ geze ɠaali ɠila nɔ.<verse eid="JDG 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13"/>Dalila ɠɛni Samesɔn ma: «Zaaɠaza ɗa gàaɓoloɠazu, zɛɛiti nɔ ɠa è ti wosu mà. Dɛɛ ga ze, nii nu ɠa è ɠili la.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samesɔn ɠɛni ma: «Ni ɗa nɔ̀un kpaɠa lɔfelaiti fɛlɛna geze vɛlɛ ɓakogi zu, è ti zei da ga pagɔ ga gului, nà ʋala sɛ̀bɛi ma, nà ɠɛ eɠɛʋelei nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ti la.»<verse eid="JDG 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14"/>Kɛai ma ɲiizu, Dalila nɔun kpaɠa lɔfelaiti fɛlɛni geze vɛlɛ ɓakogi zu, è ti zei da ga pagɔ ga gului. É ɠɛni ma: «Filisiti nuiti ta ga è zo, Samesɔn!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:14">É wuunni, é ɠula ná-ɲiimɛnii zu, é kpako guluiti tɔɔɠulani.<verse eid="JDG 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15"/>Dalila ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa zoo ɠale è ɠɛ mà: ‹Gè è nɛɛʋɛ ʋɛ.› È la laani dà! Wɛlɛ, ná zeizu ɠɛa saʋa, è ɗa gàaɓoloɠa, è la kɛɛni, è ʋa ɗa-zɛbɛ wolai zeɠezuʋɛ lɛ ga ze.» <verse eid="JDG 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16"/>Tɛi folo-o-folo é ɠɛni kpɔlɔzu, é ɗa zelii lo ma ga daawooiti, saa wɔin soni.<verse eid="JDG 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17"/>É ɠoozu vai pɛ boni ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Kpeka la dɛ vɔɔɠuni nɔ̀ungi ʋa, tɔɔzei gè yɛni dèe ɠoozu, gè ɠaliva GALA ma. Ni nɔ̀ungi a wona, nà ʋala sɛ̀bɛi ma, nà ɠɛ eɠɛʋelei nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ti la.»<verse eid="JDG 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18"/>Dalila kaai ma ga é ɠoozu vai pɛ boga ma, é wooleʋeni, ti Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti toli, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À ʋaana niizu, mazɔlɔɔ é ɠoozu vai pɛ boga mà.» Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti liini pɔ bɛ, ga waliiti ya. <verse eid="JDG 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19"/>É Samesɔn laani ɠɔɠɔi ma, naa ɲi, naa ʋolu é zunui ta lolini, naa nɔundeɠa vɛlɛa lɔfelaiti teʋe ga. Pele ɠana é tɔɔzeini la ga vɔniga ma, tɔɔzei ná-zɛbɛi ɠulani zea.<verse eid="JDG 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Filisiti nuiti ta ga è zo, Samesɔn!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:20">É wuunni, é ɠula ná-ɲiimɛnii zu, é ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Nà ɠulazu, eɠɛʋelei gè kɛai la mɔungiti su, gè ɓɔɠɔ vie!» É la ɠɛni kwɛɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeɠea polu.<verse eid="JDG 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21"/>Filisiti nuiti ti soni, ti gaazuɠɛzɛ felegɔiti kulani su. Ti yeini la Gaza, ti gili ga kɔlu ɓɔi yɔlɔɠɔi, ti pili kasoi ɠa, é ɗa molo ziɠa ɠɔtui lati.<verse eid="JDG 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Samesɔn ná-potokulai ta saa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nɔungi ɓuyega ʋoluma, nɔundeɠai tɔɔzeini ga lɛa nɔungi ma. <verse eid="JDG 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23"/>Tama, Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba, ga ti zalaɠa wola ɠula ta-ɠalagi Dagon ʋɛ, ti ɠoozunɛ. Ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu: «Gá-ɠalagi gi zili nui Samesɔn lɔa gi yeezu.»<verse eid="JDG 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24"/>Siɛgi zu nuɓusɛiti ti kaani la, ti ɠoozunɛɛni, ti ta-ɠalagi maamusɛ, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 16:24">«Gá-ɠalagi gi zili nui lɔa gi yeezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 16:24">tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni gá-yooi ɠoloɠolosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 16:24">é ɗa gá-nu mɔinmɔingiti paa.»<verse eid="JDG 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25"/>Tɛi ti wola ɠoozunɛɛni, ti ɠɛni ma: «À Samesɔn loli, é ʋa é ɠaogi wo gi ʋɛ!» Ti Samesɔn lolini, é ɠula kasoi ɠa, é ɗa ɠaogi wo ti ɠaazu. Ti toni pɛlɛi ma ɓɛdɛgiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="JDG 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26"/>Samesɔn ɠɛni zunu loungoi ma, nii é ɠɛni sosu zee ʋa: «Lo tùɠɔ, è zèe ʋɛɛ kpɛdɛgiti ba, niiti pɛlɛi zeini ti ɠa, gè yeeve ti ʋɛ.»<verse eid="JDG 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27"/>Pɛlɛ wolai naa laaveni ga nuɓusɛi, zunuiti ta anzanuiti, Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti kpein ti ɠɛni ná. Seizei bosuʋɛ pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ, miná pɛ ka naa laaveni, nu waasaʋagɔ (3.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná, zunuiti ta anzanuiti, ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu Samesɔn ʋa, é ɗa ɠaogi wo. <verse eid="JDG 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28"/>Samesɔn wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Màliɠii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI! Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, ɠizɛ sù, ee, GALA, zɛbɛi ve bɛ̀, niizu, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe nɔ, gè gàazuɠɛzɛ felegɔi vaa ʋotokula Filisiti nuiti ma!»<verse eid="JDG 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29"/>Samesɔn yeeveeni zaamazu ɓɛdɛ felegɔiti bɛ, pɛlɛi ɠɛni zeini ga, é vɔɔɠu ti ʋa, zɔi ɠɛni zeezazuʋɛ, zɔi ɠɛ kɔʋɛzuʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30"/>Naa ʋolu é ɠɛni ma: «Gi za ʋɔɔma gá Filisiti nuiti!» É ti laaʋilini ga zɛbɛi pɛ, pɛlɛi woloni Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ma, ta bɛbɛi, nii é ɠɛni ná. Nii é paani saazuʋɛ, naa mɔinni é leʋe kɛai ma vulua gele ʋa.<verse eid="JDG 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31"/>Kɛɛɠɛleaiti ta ná-nuiti kpein, ti yeini, ti ma ʋoomai zeɠe, ti lii la, ga ti maaɠulu Soleya ta Esetawɔle ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ, kɛɛɠɛ Manoa ná-kabayeɠei zu. É ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui Izilayɛle yooi zu kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) laawu.<verse eid="JDG 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17"/>
  <para style="s">Mika ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni zeini Efelayime ɠize yooi zu, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2"/>É ɠɛni dee ma: «È-ɠi ka su ga ti wali ɠae waagila ungila (1.100) unmani è ya, è unma nui voovooni gàazu. Nà ɠa gè walii naa ɠulani è ya, toɠa pɔ̀ bɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Dee ɠɛni ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo dòun zunui ʋɛ!»<verse eid="JDG 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3"/>É wali ɠae waagila ungilagi (1.100) veeni dee ya, naa ɠɛni ma: «Nà niima wali ɠaei veezu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga nà ɓɔɠɔi zeei, é ɠɛ dòun zunui ʋɛ, ga vololibai ta kɔɔɠɔ ganigi é ga kɔlui gaawuungai. Zekana gè feezu la è ya ʋolu.»<verse eid="JDG 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4"/>É wali ɠaei veeni dee ya. Dee wali ɠae unfelegɔi (200) zeɠeni, é fe kɔlu ɠaawuun nui ya. Naa vololibai ta kɔɔɠɔ ganigi ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɠaawuungai. Ti ti ʋuuni Mika ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="JDG 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5"/>Mika naa, ada zɔlɔɔni ná-pɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ é ɠɛni nɔkɔsu ná ti wu. É zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei ta pɛlɛ wu zalei taɠiligaa ɓɛtɛni, é ná-doun zunui ta zei ga ná-zalaɠa ɠula nui.<verse eid="JDG 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mika ná-zalaɠa ɠula nui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, masa ge la ɠɛni Izilayɛle unda. Ɛsɛ ge ɠɛni naa nɔ ɠɛɛzu, nii pagai gaazu. <verse eid="JDG 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7"/>Zunu loungoi ta ɠɛni Ɓɛteleyɛme laai zu, Zuda yooi zu, Zuda ná-bolodai zu. É ɠɛni ga Levi nui ta, é ɠɛni seikɔɠɔmai zu. <verse eid="JDG 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8"/>Zunui naa zeɠeni Ɓɛteleyɛme taazuʋɛ, Zuda yooi zu, é li zeizu adaʋɛ ta, ʋɛ a zei ná. É yɛni ziɛzu pelei zu, é zeeli Efelayime ɠize yooi zu, eyɛsu é zeeli Mika ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="JDG 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9"/>Mika ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa zeɠezu mini?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ga Levi nui, Ɓɛteleyɛme, Zuda yooi zu, nà liizu gè zei ʋɛ nà zoo zeizu ná.»<verse eid="JDG 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10"/>Mika ɠɛni ma: «Yɛ pɔ̀ bɛ, è ɠɛ ga kɛ̀ɛ, ta zalaɠa ɠula nui bɛ̀, nà wali ɠae puugɔ ve è ya kona gilagi laawu, é ɓɔ seɠeiti ba, ta daamianigi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:10">Levi nui ná-botii lɔɔzeini. <verse eid="JDG 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11"/>É vaani bu ɠana, é yɛ zunui naa ʋɔ bɛ, naa ɓalaa yeezeini bu, é deve ga ná-doun zunui ta. <verse eid="JDG 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12"/>Mika Levi nui zeini zalaɠa ɠula wotii unda, zunu loungoi naa ɠɛni ga ná-zalaɠa ɠula nui. É naa laazuʋɛɛni ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="JDG 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13"/>Mika ɠɛni ma: «Niizu, gè kwɛɛga ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa faanɛɛ ɠɛ bɛ̀, tɔɔzei Levi nui nii ɠa bà ga zalaɠa ɠula nui.»<verse eid="JDG 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18"/>
  <para style="s">Zou ɠaiziɛ vai Dan mavofodaiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, masa ge la ɠɛni Izilayɛle unda. Dan mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni zou ɠaiziɛzu, ʋɛ ta zei ná. Mazɔlɔɔ eyɛsu naama ziɛgi zu zeeli, ti la ɠɛni dɛ zou zɔlɔɔni Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei zɔiti saama. <verse eid="JDG 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2"/>Dan mavofodaiti ti zunu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ dɔɔlugɔ ɠulani ɓɔɠɔ zaama, ti zeɠe Soleya ta Esetawɔle, ti li ti zooi ʋɛtɛ, ti ziɛziɛ su. Ti ɠɛni ti ma: «À li, wo zooi zuʋɛtɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:2">Ti zeelini Efelayime ɠize yooi zu, eyɛsu ti li Mika ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti ɲi ná. <verse eid="JDG 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3"/>Ti maaɓuɠaai ma Mika ná-pɛlɛi ʋa, ti Levi zunu loungoi wooi ʋaaɠulabai ɠwɛɛni, ti ɠale ma, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa paai ga ɗe ʋɛ? Leeni ɠa è kɛɛzu ʋɛ? Leeni vaa zu è yɛsu ʋɛ?»<verse eid="JDG 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4"/>Nii kpein Mika kɛɛni bɛ, é naati boni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Toɠa ɗa sàla, gè ɠɛa ga ná-zalaɠa ɠula nui.»<verse eid="JDG 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5"/>Názu ɠa ti ɠɛni ma la: «Gá è maanɛɛnɛzu, GALA gaazaɠa dɛɛ, gi kwɛɛ ni siɛi gi tɔɔzeiɗa, toɠa zoloo.»<verse eid="JDG 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li ziilɛigi zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa wo ʋa, siɛi zu wo tɔɔzeizu.»<verse eid="JDG 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7"/>Zunu lɔɔlugɔi naati ti liini, ti zeeli Layise. Ti nuɓusɛiti kaani ti zeini ná, ti laai ɓɔɠɔ la, ga Sidɔn nuiti kɛʋele, ti yiilɛiɗai kitogi zu. Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ti ɓɔlɔzu ti-maaɠoolii zu, ɓaa é ʋa zei ti unda. Ti maaɠoozani Sidɔn nuiti ba, kpɔfaama la ɠɛni ti yɔɠɔzu ta nu nɔpɛ.<verse eid="JDG 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8"/>Zunu lɔɔlugɔi naati ti ɠaleni ma, ti li ti-ɠɛɛleaiti pɔ bɛ Soleya ta Esetawɔle, naati ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa ɠa siɛi ma?»<verse eid="JDG 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9"/>Ti ɠɛni ti ma: «À wuzeɠe! Ade lɛ ti laalɔɠɔma, mazɔlɔɔ gi zooi ɠaaʋɛ, gola ʋagɛ. Toɠa ɠale! Wa zeini nɔ, wo la faa wosu! À mina ɠɛ ga dɔɔʋɛ nui. À pele zo, wo li wo zooi naa zo! <verse eid="JDG 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10"/>Wa zeelina náʋɛ, wa nuɓusɛiti ka ná, ti laai ɓɔɠɔ la. Zou ʋe gola wɔɔlɔai, GALA ge fea wo ya, ada ʋe nu la ʋalaga ani nɔpɛ ma ná, anii nii kpein nɔ é eteai zu.»<verse eid="JDG 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11"/>Zunu undɔzita (600), Dan mavofodaiti su, naati ka ti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti seɠeni, ti zeɠe Soleya ta Esetawɔle. <verse eid="JDG 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12"/>Ti lɛɛni, ti kɔɔlaaɠai ʋu Kiliyate-Yeyalime ʋoluʋɛ, Zuda yooi zu. Naa ɠa é ba, naama adaʋɛ laasei pɛai ga Maɠané-Dan, zaaɠaza (nii poluʋɛ ga «Dan ná-kɔɔlaaɠai»). <verse eid="JDG 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13"/>Ti zeɠeni miná, ti li Efelayime ɠize yooi zu, eyɛsu ti zeeli Mika ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="JDG 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14"/>Zunu lɔɔlugɔi niiti ti liini Layise yooi zuʋɛtɛsu, naati ti ɠɛni ti-wɔɔlaiti ma: «Wo suɠwɛɛ nɛi ɓaa, ga zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei ɠa pɛlɛi nii ta wu, ta pɛlɛ wu zaleiti, ta vololibai, ta kɔɔɠɔ ganigi taɠili, nii é ga kɔlu ɠaawuungai? À naa leve, nii wa kɛ.» <verse eid="JDG 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15"/>Ti ɠaleni ma miná, ti lɛ Levi zunu loungoi ná-pɛlɛi wu, Mika ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti tuʋɔgi wo. <verse eid="JDG 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16"/>Názu niina, Dan mavofodaiti, nu undɔzitai (600) niiti kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai ɠɛni ti ya, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai kɔɔɠɔ vai ma, naati ti ɠɛni loni pɛlɛlaʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17"/>Zunu lɔɔlugɔi niiti ti liini zooi zuʋɛtɛsu, naati ti lɛɛni, ti vololibai zeɠe, ta zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei, ta pɛlɛ wu zaleiti, ta kɔɔɠɔ ganigi, nii é ɠɛni ga kɔlu ɠaawuungai. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠɛni loni pɛlɛlaʋɛ ta nu undɔzitaiti (600) niiti kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai ɠɛni ti ya.<verse eid="JDG 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui zɔiti kaai ma, ti lɛ Mika ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti vololibai zeɠe, ta zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei, ta pɛlɛ wu zaleiti, ta kɔɔɠɔ ganigi é ga kɔlu ɠaawuungai, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Leeni ɠa wo kɛɛzu miná?»<verse eid="JDG 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Maaɠɛ kpɔ! Yeeʋɛɛ la, è ʋilɛ gi ʋolu, ɠɛ ga ɠɛɛɠɛi gi ʋɛ, ta zalaɠa ɠula nui. Fizɔgɛ è ma nɛi ɓaa, è ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui zunu ɠilagi nɔ ʋɛ, ɓaa è ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui bolodai ʋɛ, ta pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ, Izilayɛle yooi zu?»<verse eid="JDG 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui wola ɠoozunɛ naama vai zu. É zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei zeɠeni, ta pɛlɛ wu zaleiti, ta vololibai, é ʋilɛ nuɓusɛiti saama.<verse eid="JDG 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21"/>Ti pele zoni, ti ɗa li, ti doungoiti toni luɠɔ, ta toganiiti, ta kasɔiti.<verse eid="JDG 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22"/>Ti maaɠoozaai ma Mika ná-pɛlɛi ʋa, Mika zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti ɓɔɠɔ lolini, ti ʋilɛ Dan ná-nuiti polu. <verse eid="JDG 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23"/>Ti ɠɛni kpeei loozu Dan ná-nuiti polu, naati ti ɠaleni ma, ti ɠɛ Mika ma: «Leeni ɠa kɛai, è toligi wosu ɠana?»<verse eid="JDG 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nà-galagiti gè ti ɓɛtɛni, wo ti zeɠea, é ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋa, wo lia ga tiye, lee ɠili ka niina zɛgai zèa, wa gaazaɠa mà vaa zu?»<verse eid="JDG 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25"/>Dan ná-nuiti ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Mina gi woizuɓɔlɔ! Tanisu gi zaama, nui tanigaa yiiɠaawana, ti loo è ma. Toɠa ɠɛ ga è undaaʋili faa, wa ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei.» <verse eid="JDG 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26"/>Dan ná-nuiti ti pele zoni, ti ɗa li. Mika kaai ma ga ta-zobogi wɔɔlɔʋɛ nɔnɔi ʋa, é ɠaleni ma, é li ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="JDG 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dan mavofodaiti ti zei vai Layise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27"/>Nii kpein Mika kpɛtɛni, zekana Dan ná-nuiti ti naati seɠeni la, ti li ga tiye, é ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋa, é ɠɛni zea. Naa ʋoluma, ti laalɛɛni Layise wu, ti nuɓusɛiti paa, niiti ti ɠaalɛini, ti laai ɓɔɠɔ la, ti zeini ziilɛigi zu, naa ʋolu ti abui loni taai ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ʋaani, é ʋa ɓɔ ti ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ ti maaɠoozani Sidɔn yooi ʋa, kpɔfaama la ɠɛni ti yɔɠɔzu ta nu nɔpɛ, ná ɠɛni nɛmɛi zu, nii é Ɓɛte-Leɠɔɓe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:28">Dan ná-nuiti ti taai loni ʋolu, ti zei ná. <verse eid="JDG 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29"/>Ti taai laasei pɛɛni ga Dan, ti-mɛmɛwola Dan laaseigi, Izilayɛle ná-doun zunui, kɛlɛ mɔungi daaseigi ɠɛni ga Layise. <verse eid="JDG 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30"/>Dan ná-nuiti ti vololibai naa ɠaalɔni ná, ti Zonatan zei ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, Dan mavofodaiti bɛ, nii é ɠɛni ga Gɛɛlɛsome ná-doun zunui, Moize<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Moize</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Eɓulu woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai zu, naa ɠa ga: </char><char style="fqa">Manasé</char>.</note> ná-dounloin. Naa mavofodaiti ka ti ɠɛni naama wotii ma, eyɛsu ti li ga tiye duɔlai zu. <verse eid="JDG 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31"/>Vololibai nii Mika kpɛtɛni, ti naa makɛni, GALA pɛlɛi nii é ɠɛni Silo, naa ná-yeeɠɛɠalai kpein daawu.<verse eid="JDG 18:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19"/>
  <para style="s">Giɓea laaʋeaiti ta-vaa ɲɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, masa ge la ɠɛni Izilayɛle unda. Levi nui ta ɠɛni ná, é ɠɛni zeini Efelayime ɠize yooi ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ, é anzai ta zeɠeni Ɓɛteleyɛme Zuda yooi zu, nii é la vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele. <verse eid="JDG 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2"/>Kɛlɛ anzanui naa ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔni koloɠologi zu, é zeɠeni pɔ bɛ, é ɠale ma kɛɛɠɛ ʋɔ bɛ Ɓɛteleyɛme, é kɛɛni ná ga alu naanigɔ. <verse eid="JDG 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3"/>Sinigi wuzeɠeni, é li pɔ bɛ, é ʋa ɓɔɛ pɔ, é ziila, é lii la. Ná-botiɠɛ zunu loungoi ɠɛni ba, ta soovale felegɔ. Anzanu loungoi naa lɛɛni kɛɛɠɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu, siɛgi zu kɛɛɠɛ zunui ɠaani la, é yeezeini bu ga koozunɛ.<verse eid="JDG 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4"/>Nɛkoi, anzanu loungoi kɛɛɠɛ, naa yeeʋilini su, é yɛ naa ʋɔ bɛ, é kɛ ná ga folo saʋagɔ. Ti ɗa daamii wo, ti ɗa ɓɔɔle, ti ɗa ɲi ná. <verse eid="JDG 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5"/>Foloi naanisiɛi, ti wuzeɠeni ga sobuzobui, Levi nui ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ga é li. Kɛlɛ anzanu loungoi kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni nɛkoi ma: «Ani go mi, è zɛbɛ zɔlɔɔ, wa li niina.»<verse eid="JDG 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6"/>Ti zeini, ti daamii wo, ti ɓɔɔle ʋɔɔma ti felegɔ. Naa ʋolu anzanu loungoi kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni anzazinigi ma: «Deve, è ɲi ʋɛ, è yiilɛi.» <verse eid="JDG 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7"/>Anzazinigi wuzeɠeni ga é li, kɛlɛ nɛkoi ɠilini ma, é kpidi ɠila kɛɛni ná mɔnɔ. <verse eid="JDG 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8"/>Foloi lɔɔlusiɛi, é wuzeɠeni ga sobuzobui ga é li. Anzanui kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni ma: «Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, ani go mi, wo naa maaɓɔun, foloi gaayei.» Ti felegɔ pɛ ti daamii woni.<verse eid="JDG 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9"/>Anzazinigi wuzeɠeni, ga ti li ta anzai nii é la ɠɛni fuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele, ta ná-botiɠɛ zunu loungoi, kɛlɛ anzai kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni ma: «Wɛlɛ foloi gaayeiɗa, woza lia, à ɲi ʋɛ, foloi lia. À ɲi ʋɛ, è yiiɠaalɛi, lina wa wuzeɠe ga sobuzobui, wo ʋilɛ pelei zu, è li ɗa-laazu.» <verse eid="JDG 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10"/>Anzazinigi la ɠɛni pɔ ga é ʋa ɲi ná, é wuzeɠeni, é li. É zeelini Yeɓuse ɠakalaʋɛ, nii é ga Zeluzalɛme, ta soovale felegɔiti ti maaɠiliai, ta anzai nii é la ɠɛni vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele.<verse eid="JDG 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11"/>Siɛgi zu ti zeelini la Yeɓuse, foloi wola liini niina. Botiɠɛ zunu loungoi ɠɛni maliɠii ma: «Ade li, de lati Yeɓuse nuiti ta-laai tɛi ma, ade ɲi ná.»<verse eid="JDG 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12"/>Maliɠii gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o, ade la laazu zii ɠiligiti ta-laazu, ʋɛ Izilayɛle nu la ná, ada ɲiizu Giɓea.» <verse eid="JDG 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13"/>É ɠɛni mɔnɔ ná-botiɠɛ zunu loungoi ma: «Ade li, de maaɓuɠa nuuma adaʋɛti ta ʋa, Giɓea ɓaa Lama, de ɲi ná.» <verse eid="JDG 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14"/>Ti yɛni ziɛzu eyɛsu foloi da, siɛgi zu ti maaɓuɠani la Giɓea ʋa, nii é Ɓɛnzamɛn yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15"/>Ti latini eyɛsu ti zeeli miná, ti ɲi Giɓea. Levi nui lɛɛni, é lo taa zaamaʋɛ. Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni suzoni, é ʋa daazuʋɛɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu, ga é ɲi ná.<verse eid="JDG 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16"/>Gaaɓelasu, kɛwola wɔlɔi ta ʋaani kpɔkɔi, é zeɠe boti ɠɛɛzuʋɛ kpalagaʋɛ, zunui naa ɠɛni ga Efelayime ɠize yooi zu nui ta, é ɠɛni zeini Giɓea, kɛlɛ náʋɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ga Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti. <verse eid="JDG 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17"/>É ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, é wɛɛin ɠa taa zaamaʋɛ. Kɛwolai ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa liizu mini? Ɗa zeɠezu mini?»<verse eid="JDG 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18"/>É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gá zeɠezu Ɓɛteleyɛme Zuda yooi zu, gá liizu Efelayime ɠize yooi ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ, miná ɠa gè zɔlɔɔni ná. Pàaʋɛ, gè zeɠe Ɓɛteleyɛme Zuda yooi zu, nà liizu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-pɛlɛi wu, kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é yeezeizu bù. <verse eid="JDG 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19"/>Tama, tufai ɠa gi ya soovalegiti kɔnɔ fai zu, ta ɓului ɓalaa, ta dɔɔi, gi ʋɛ ga ànzai ta nà-botiɠɛ nui, gi ɓɛdɛ la ani nɔpɛ ba.»<verse eid="JDG 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20"/>Kɛwolai ɠɛni ma naazu: «Ziilɛigi ɠɛ è ʋɛ! Gè minazeɠea ga è-maavai pɛ, è la ɲia taa zaamaʋɛ.» <verse eid="JDG 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21"/>É ti lɛɛni ná-pɛlɛi wu, é tufai ve soovalegiti zea. Siɛʋeaiti ti ɠɔɠɔiti maagbani, naa ʋolu ti daamii wo, ti ɓɔɔle.<verse eid="JDG 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni ɠoozunɛɛzu la, taazuʋɛ zunuiti, nu ɲakaiti, ti ʋaani ti ɠaku pɛlɛi ma, ti ɗa daa ziɠa, ti ɗa ɠɛ kɛwola wɔlɔi ma, pɛlɛ kɛɛ nui: «Zunui ɠula, nii tɛai è ʋɔ bɛ, gi ɓɛdɛ ɠula la!»<verse eid="JDG 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23"/>Pɛlɛ kɛɛ nui ɠulani, é li ti ʋɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓa-o, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu, tɔɔzei zunui nii ɠa ga mà wɛɛn, à mina tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo faa ɠɛ. <verse eid="JDG 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24"/>Wɛlɛ dòun anzanui ʋa, kpeaai, ta zunui anzai, nà ɠulazu ga naati. À loo naati ma, wo naa ɠɛ nii wo wɔinni wo kɛ. Kɛlɛ à mina tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo faa wolai naa ɠɛ ga zunui nii.»<verse eid="JDG 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25"/>Zunui naati ti la ɠɛni woiloni goo ma. Názu ɠa Levi nui anzai zoni la, é kula eteaʋɛ. Ti ʋuuni ma, ti ʋooʋa ma, é zo kpidii ma eyɛsu sobui, naa ʋolu sobuzobui ti yeeɓe ba. <verse eid="JDG 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26"/>Sobui, anzanui naa ʋaani, é loo zunui naa ná-pɛlɛlaʋɛ, ʋɛ sinigi ɠɛni ná, eyɛsu woza ɠala.<verse eid="JDG 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27"/>Sobui sinigi wuzeɠeni, é pɛlɛi laalao, é ɠula, é ʋa li ná-siɛi ma. Kɛlɛ anzanui naa, é ga anzai nii é la ɠɛni fuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele, é naa ɠaani laani nu lɛɛzuʋɛ pɛlɛi wu, zeeiti pɛai kpofalagi ma. <verse eid="JDG 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Wuzeɠe, de li!» Kɛlɛ gooɠaaʋote ge la ɠɛni veeni. Sinigi seɠeni, é pɛɛ soovalegi gila kɔma, é ʋilɛ pelei zu, é ɗa li ná-taazu.<verse eid="JDG 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29"/>Seeliai ma ná-pɛlɛi wu, é boɠai zeɠeni, é anzai leʋeleʋe, é kɛ ga ma ɓulukpulu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), é teʋeni Izilayɛle yooi zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="JDG 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30"/>Niiti kpein ti naa ɠaani, ti ɠɛni ma: «Nii ɠɛɠala vaa nɔpɛ ge la dɛ ɠɛɛni, nu la dɛ ta ɠaani, kaipa Izilayɛle nuiti ti lɛɛni, ti ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa, eyɛsu zaaɠaza. À ɠisiɛ su, wo ɓɔɠɔ ɠa, wo deve wo!»<verse eid="JDG 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti ti devei wo fai <optbreak/> Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1"/>Izilayɛle nuiti kpein ti ʋaani, é zo Dan, é li Ɓeel-Seɓa, eyɛsu Galaade yooi zu, bɛbɛi ɠaalɛɛni ba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala eɠɛ nu ɠila nɔ Misepa. <verse eid="JDG 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2"/>Nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti kpein, ti ga Izilayɛle wolodamaiti, ti ɠɛni GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti ta-maaɓɔgi zu, zunu waaunnaanigɔ (400.000) ɠɛni ná, niiti ti ɠɛni ziɛzu ɠɔɠɔa, boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠɛni ti ya. <verse eid="JDG 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti mɛnini ga Izilayɛle nuiti ti lɛɛni Misepa. Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Ʋelei faa ɲɔi nii ʋaai la, à naa wo lɛɛ gi ma.»<verse eid="JDG 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4"/>Levi nui nii ti anzai ʋaani, naa ɠɛni ti ma: «Ànzai nii é la ɠɛni vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele, gá naa ɠa gi ʋaani Giɓea Ɓɛnzamɛn yooi zu, ga gi ɲi ná. <verse eid="JDG 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5"/>Taaʋeaiti ti laalɛɛni nɔ̀un bu. Kpidii, ti pɛlɛi maalatini, ʋɛ gè ɠɛni ná, ti ɠɛ ti pàa. Ti ʋilɛni ànzai ʋolu, ti yɛ laazu la eyɛsu ti paa. <verse eid="JDG 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6"/>Gè ma ʋoomai zeɠeni, gè teʋeleʋe, gè sei su puu maazu fele (12), gè teʋe Izilayɛle yooi zu ná pɛ. Tɔɔzei ɲamaba vai é ga tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠologi niima zii ɠɛa Izilayɛle yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7"/>Wɛlɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti wo kpein ka, wo ɠaalɛai ba, à unpilɛna, wo faa ɠila deve!»<verse eid="JDG 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8"/>Nuɓusɛi kpein ge wuzeɠeni sɔ gilagi zu, ti ɠɛ ma: «Nu ɠila kpalaa ge la ɠalesu ma ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, nu ɠila kpalaa ge la liizu ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="JDG 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9"/>Wɛlɛ nii ade kɛɛzu niina ga Giɓea nuiti, ada kpakutoomai ɠɛɛzu, ade kwɛɛ nii da kɛ ga tiye. <verse eid="JDG 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10"/>Izilayɛle wolodai kpein su, ada nu puugɔ zeɠezu nu ungilagi (100) zu, ta nu ungila (100) nu waagilagi (1.000) zu, ta nu waagila (1.000) nu waapuugɔi (10.000) zu, ta liizu ti daamiani gaiziɛ nuɓusɛiti bɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ ta ɠalena ma, ade Giɓea zo, nii é Ɓɛnzamɛn yooi zu, eɠɛʋelei ta-ɲamaba vaa ɲɔi la, ti kɛai Izilayɛle yooi zu.» <verse eid="JDG 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11"/>Zekana Izilayɛle zunuiti kpein ti ɠaalɛɛni ba la taai laalɔɠɔma, eɠɛ zunu ɠila kpe nɔ.<verse eid="JDG 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12"/>Izilayɛle wolodaiti ti zunuiti teʋeni Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ma, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɲamaba vai, nii ɲɔuɗai, naa ɠɛɛʋɛ ɠale wo zaama? <verse eid="JDG 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13"/>Gaamago nɔ, su mina ɠooza, à nu ɲakaiti fe gi ya, niiti ti Giɓea, gi ti undaaʋili, gi faa ɲɔi ɠula Izilayɛle zaama ɠana!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:13">Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti la ɠɛni kɛɛni, ti ʋa woilo ti-ɠɛɛleaiti goo ma, Izilayɛle nuiti. <verse eid="JDG 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti zeɠeni ta-laa wolaiti su, ti ɠaalɛ ba Giɓea, ti ʋa li ga kɔɔi Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="JDG 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti gaaluni ma volo ná, ti ɠɛni ga, zunu waaʋuufele maazu lɔzita (26.000), niiti boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠɛni ti ya, Giɓea taaʋeaiti ti la naama ɠaalugi zu, tɔɔzei naati tiegi ɠɛni ga nu undɔfela (700), ti ga kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti. <verse eid="JDG 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16"/>Naama ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti saama, kɔʋɛ nui ɠɛni ti zaama ga nu undɔfela (700), naati kpein ti ɠɛni zoosu ti kɔtui ʋili ga fɛlɛvɛlɛgi, ti la ʋoola nu undeɠa ɠila kpegi ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17"/>Ti Izilayɛle nuiti gaaluni ɓalaa, ti ɠɛni ga nu waaunnaanigɔ (400.000), niiti boɠa zɔkpɔi ti ya, ti ga kɔɔɠɔ nuiti, Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti la naama ɠaalugi zu.<verse eid="JDG 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔi ɠɔɔ vai <optbreak/> Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti wuzeɠeni, ti lɛ Ɓetɛle, ti GALA gaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi zaama ɓɛ ɠa a lɛ dɛ mɔunpa, é Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti sakpe?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Zuda nuiti ka ta lɛ ti tɔɔzei.»<verse eid="JDG 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19"/>Geelaalaoni nɔ feya, Izilayɛle nuiti ti wuzeɠe ti ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai ʋu Giɓea ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20"/>Ti ɠulani, ti li ga ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛ Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ba, ti ɓɔɠɔ zeini su, ti lo Giɓea laawu. <verse eid="JDG 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti ɠulani Giɓea, ti Izilayɛle nui ʋaani kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ naama volo ná ga nu waaʋuufele maazu fele (22.000). <verse eid="JDG 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22"/>Nuɓusɛiti, Izilayɛle nuiti, ti ɓɔɠɔ iɲɔdɔɔni, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni kɔɔɠɔ vai ma mɔnɔ ga niinɛ naama adaʋɛ nɔ, ʋɛ ti ɠɛni ʋuuni ná folo mɔungi. <verse eid="JDG 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti lɛɛni, ti wɔlɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi maanɛɛʋɛ nɛi gi kɔɔ laalɛ Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti bu, gi-ɠɛɛleaiti?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ti ma: «À li ti laalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="JDG 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24"/>Poluma zobui, Izilayɛle nuiti ti laalɛɛni Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti bu ʋolu, ná zeizu velesiɛi. <verse eid="JDG 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25"/>Ná zeizu velesiɛi naa, Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti ɠulani Giɓea, ti ti laaɠomi, ti nu waapuugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18.000) ʋaani Izilayɛle ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti ba, kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, ti zoogai boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋilisu.<verse eid="JDG 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26"/>Izilayɛle nuiti kpein, ti ma ʋɛbɛiti ti lɛɛni Ɓetɛle. Ti yɛni zeini ná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, ti ɗa wɔlɔ, ti zugi zo eyɛsu kpɔkɔi, ti gala zalaɠaiti kula, ta ziilɛi zalaɠaiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala. <verse eid="JDG 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27"/>Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazaɠani mɔnɔ. Naama ziɛgi zu, miná ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="JDG 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28"/>Eleazaal ná-doun zunui, Fineyase, nii é ga Aalɔn ná-dounloin, naa ɠa é ɠɛni botii zu naama ɠonagi. Ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi maanɛɛʋɛ gi li mɔnɔ, gi gi-ɠɛɛleaiti sakpe, Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti, ɓaa gi looɠo?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ti ma: «À li, mazɔlɔɔ lina, nà zobo feezu wo ʋɛ, wo pilɛ sɔlɔɔ ti ma.»<verse eid="JDG 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29"/>Izilayɛle nuiti, ti zunuiti seini dɔɔɠuzu Giɓea maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="JDG 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30"/>Naa ʋolu, ti liini, ti laalɛ Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti bu ná foloi zaʋasiɛi. Ti ɓɔɠɔ zeini su kɔɔɠɔ vai ma Giɓea luɠɔ, eɠɛʋelei ma mɔun felegɔi ɠɛni la. <verse eid="JDG 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti ɠulani kɔɔɠɔ vai ma, ti ɓeni ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ti yeeɓeteʋe taai ʋa. Ti tɔɔzeini ga nuiti paa nuɓusɛiti saama, eɠɛʋelei nɔ ti kɛɛni la mɔungiti su, pelei naati su, nii gilagi lɛɛzu ga Ɓetɛle ʋele, gilagi ɗa li ga Giɓea ʋele ɓalaɠai zu. Izilayɛle zunui ti paani, é ɠɛni ga nu ʋuusaʋagɔ (30).<verse eid="JDG 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ade vɔniga ti ma ga mɔungi nɔ ɠɛʋelei.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:32">Kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu: «Ade ʋela ti ʋa, de ti ɓeteʋe taai ʋa, de li ga tiye pelei zu.»<verse eid="JDG 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33"/>Izilayɛle zunui kpein ge zeɠeni losuʋɛti, ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ Ɓaale-Tamaal. Izilayɛle ná-nuiti ti lɔɔɠuni, naati ti zeɠeni Maalé-Geɓa, ʋɛ ti ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="JDG 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34"/>Kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ waapuugɔ (10.000), niiti zeelobai woni ga tiye Izilayɛle zaama, naati ti zeelini Giɓea ɠakalaʋɛ. Kɔɔi wola ɓɔini, kɛlɛ Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti la ɠɛni kwɛɛ ga maanɔɠɔi ɠa ʋaazu ti ʋɔ. <verse eid="JDG 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti sakpeni Izilayɛle ʋɛ, naama voloi, Izilayɛle zunu waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ ungila (25.100) paani, ti pɛ ti zoogai kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi.<verse eid="JDG 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti kwɛɛni ga Izilayɛle nuiti ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔga ti ma. Izilayɛle zunuiti ti kɛɛni, eɠɛ ta ɠɛ ʋelazu Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ba, kɛlɛ ti-ɠigi ɠɛni ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti ba, niiti ti lɔɔɠuni Giɓea ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37"/>Názu ɠa nui naati ti lɔɔɠuni, ti ɠulani la, ti loo Giɓea zu, ti vaza taazuʋɛ, ti nuiti undaaʋili. <verse eid="JDG 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38"/>Ti zolooni ma ta Izilayɛle ɠɔɔɠɔ nui zɔiti, ga ti abui lo, ma luului wuzeɠe taazuʋɛ, é ɗa lɛ geezuʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39"/>Izilayɛle zunuiti ti ɠaaʋoteni ʋolu ti ma, ga kɔɔɠɔi. Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti nu ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ɠɛɠala ʋaani niina ti ʋa, naa maaʋele ma, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ti ʋoluazoga, ti ɗa ʋela ade ʋa, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni la kɔɔɠɔ volo mɔungi zu.»<verse eid="JDG 20:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40"/>Gaamanɔ, duulu wolai tɔɔzeini ga wuzeɠea taazuʋɛ. Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti latini, ti ka ga abuzogi ɠa ta-laai ʋa, ma abuzogi ɗa lɛ geezuʋɛ. <verse eid="JDG 20:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41"/>Názu ɠa Izilayɛle zunuiti ti ɠaleni ma la Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti daalɔɠɔma, naati ti wola zuluani. Mazɔlɔɔ ti undaaʋiligi ɠaani, nii é ɠɛni ti luɠɔ. <verse eid="JDG 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42"/>Ti ʋoluaveni Izilayɛle zunuiti ba, ti ɗa li ga teʋebai zu ʋele. Kɛlɛ kɔɔi la ɠɛni ɓudɛni ti maazu, niiti ti zeɠeni taazu ʋelei, naati ti ɠɛni ti ʋaazu, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ti yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="JDG 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti maalatini, ti ʋilɛni ti ʋolu, ti ɗa ti ʋaa, ʋɛ kpein ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti looɠo ná, eyɛsu Giɓea letemaʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei. <verse eid="JDG 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44"/>Ti Ɓɛnzamɛn zunu waapuugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18.000) ʋaani, ti pɛ ti ga kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti. <verse eid="JDG 20:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45"/>Niiti ti yɛni vulua, naati ti ɓizɛni, ti li teʋebai zu, Limon fasai ʋɔ pelei, ti nu waadɔɔlugɔ (5.000) ʋaani naati saama pelei zu, ti ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, eyɛsu ti zeeli Gidome, ti nu waafelegɔ (2.000) ʋaa ti ʋa miná.<verse eid="JDG 20:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nui liegɔi é zaani, é ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuufele maazu lɔɔlu (25.000), ti pɛ ti ga kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti. <verse eid="JDG 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47"/>Zunu undɔzita (600), niiti ti ʋoluaveni, ti ʋela ti li teʋebai zu, Limon fasai ʋɔ pelei, naati ti yɛni miná eyɛsu alu naanigɔ. <verse eid="JDG 20:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48"/>Naa ʋoluma, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠaaʋoteni Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti daalɔɠɔma, ti ɗa zunuiti paa ga boɠa zɔkpɔi taaiti su, ta toganiiti, ta niiti kpein nɔ ti ɠɛni ti ɠaazu luɠɔ. Ti abui loni taaiti kpein ba, ma yooi zu, niiti ti ti ɠaani.<verse eid="JDG 20:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodai ʋuu vai su ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1"/>Zunuiti ti ɠonani Misepa ga ti la mɔ ti-loun anzanu vea Ɓɛnzamɛn nu ʋɛ ga vulu.<verse eid="JDG 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ʋaani Ɓetɛle, ti yɛni zeini ná GALA kakala eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. Ti yɛni zɔngɔzu, ti ɗa wɔlɔ gola, <verse eid="JDG 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Leeni vaa zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, niima vaa ɲɔu zii ɠɛai Izilayɛle? Leeni vaa zu Izilayɛle ʋalagai za ná-bolodai gila ma?»<verse eid="JDG 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4"/>Poluma zobui, nuɓusɛiti kpein ti wuzeɠeni ga sobuzobui, ti zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ loni náʋɛ. Ti gala zalaɠaiti kulani ta ziilɛi zalaɠaiti. <verse eid="JDG 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5"/>Naa ʋolu, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Izilayɛle wolodai kpein su, ma ɓɛgele ɠa é laade zaama, gaalɛbai zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu?» Mazɔlɔɔ ti konai woni naama nui laalɔɠɔma, nii é la ʋaani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala Misepa, é woni ga ta naama nui ʋaa.<verse eid="JDG 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti-ɠɛɛloin Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-fai ma maawɔin ti zoni, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Za, bolodai gila kpeteʋea Izilayɛle ʋa. <verse eid="JDG 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7"/>Leeni ɠa ada kɛ ti ʋɛ, nii a kɛ niiti ti yɛgai vulua, naati ti anza zɔlɔɔ? Tɔɔzei de ɠonani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga de la de-loun anzanuiti ta vea ti ya ga anza.» <verse eid="JDG 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Nui ta ɠa ná nɛi ɓaa, Izilayɛle ná-bolodaiti saama, nii é la lɛɛni Misepa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala?» Ti kaani ga Yaɓese nii é Galaade, naa ná-nu ɠila kpalaa ge la ɠɛni ʋaani kɔɔlaaɠai zu, ta maaɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="JDG 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9"/>Ti nuɓusɛiti gaalugai ma, Yaɓese nii é Galaade, ti la ɠɛni naa ná-nu ɠila kpalaa kaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti kɔɔɠɔ nu waapuugɔ maazu felegɔ (12.000) leʋeni, ti devei ve ti ya, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «À li Galaade yooi zu, wo Yaɓese laaʋeaiti pɛ paa, anzanuiti pɛ ta doungoiti. <verse eid="JDG 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11"/>Wɛlɛ ʋelei wa kɛ la, à zunuiti kpein suwuɠaaleʋe, ta anzanui kpein niiti ti zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ.» <verse eid="JDG 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12"/>Kɔɔɠɔ nui naati ti anzalopo ɓea unnaanigɔ (400) ɠaani Yaɓese taaʋeaiti saama, Galaade yooi zu, niiti zunu la ɠɛni dɛ vɔɔɠuni ti ʋa. Ti liini ga tiye, Silo kɔɔlaaɠai zu, Kanaan yooi zu.<verse eid="JDG 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13"/>Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti keelaiti teʋeni Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ma, niiti ti lɔɔɠuni Limon fasai ma, nii a kɛ ti yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ, ziilɛigi ɠɛ ti zaama. <verse eid="JDG 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti ti ɠaleni ma. Ti anzanuiti feeni ti ya, niiti ti la ɠɛni ti ʋaani Yaɓese, Galaade yooi zu, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni kula ɠɛɛni ti ʋa.<verse eid="JDG 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti maawɔin nuɓusɛiti soni, tɔɔzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeɠe ɲaka wɔɔni Izilayɛle wolodamaiti saama. <verse eid="JDG 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16"/>Bɛbɛi ma ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Ada kɛ ɠale, de ʋa anzanu zɔlɔɔ zɔiti bɛ, ti yɛgai vulua, tɔɔzei Ɓɛnzamɛn anzanuiti kpein undaaʋiligɛ?» <verse eid="JDG 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17"/>Ti ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ: «Niiti ti yɛgai vulua Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti saama, naati ti ta-ʋoganiiti makɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ bolodai ta ɠaa mina ʋala ba Izilayɛle zu. <verse eid="JDG 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18"/>Kɛlɛ ade la zooga de ʋa de-loun anzanui ta ve ti ʋɛ ga anza.» Mazɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle nuiti ti konai woni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Naama nui ɠotoʋɛ, nii a anza ve Ɓɛnzamɛn nui ta ya!» <verse eid="JDG 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Wɛlɛ kona-o-kona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-fɛtii ɠa ɗa ɠula Silo, nii é Ɓetɛle lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, é lo pelei naa ʋa folo ɠulazu ʋelei, nii é zeɠezu Ɓetɛle é ɗa li Sikɛme, ta Leɓona lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ.»<verse eid="JDG 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20"/>Naa ʋolu, ti niima levei veeni Ɓɛnzamɛn nuiti zea, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «À li wo lɔɔɠu ná, leezɛn ɓeleiti su. <verse eid="JDG 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21"/>Siɛgi zu wo Silo anzalopoiti kaazu la, ti ɗa kuai wo, ti ɗa lati, wa ɠula leezɛn ɓelei zu, wo ɠilagilagi ɠa anzalopo ɠila so ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ga anza, wo li ga tiye Ɓɛnzamɛn yooi zu. <verse eid="JDG 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22"/>Ni ti-ɠɛɛni, ɓaa ti-ɠɛɛleaiti, ta ʋaana ti ɓaazaɠa gi ʋɔ bɛ, gá ɠɛ ti ma: ‹À gi maawɔinɠa, mazɔlɔɔ gi la anzanu zɔlɔɔni ti ʋɛ kɔɔi zu. Wa laade wo ʋa fe ti ya, ni wa ɠɛni de, wa la ɠɛ ga sɔba nu.› »<verse eid="JDG 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23"/>Zekana Ɓɛnzamɛn zunuiti ti kɛɛni la, ti anzanuiti seɠeni ga ti-liegɔi, é ɠula anzalopoiti saama, niiti ti ɠɛni kuai wosu Silo, naa ʋolu ti li ga tiye. Ti ta-laaiti to ʋolu, ti zei ná, ta-ʋoganiiti saama ti ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="JDG 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24"/>Naama ziɛgi nɔ zu, Izilayɛle nui zɔiti ti liini ta-wolodaiti su, ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bu, ti ɠilagilagi ti zei ta-ʋoganii unda.<verse eid="JDG 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, masa ge la ɠɛni Izilayɛle unda. Ɛsɛ ge ɠɛni naa nɔ ɠɛɛzu, nii pagai gaazu.<verse eid="JDG 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21"/>
</usx>
